ee":{"sha":"ce8c114e3ba673e7218a17451e2e644a112d38c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dkoenawan/design-patterns-of-everything/git/trees/ce8c114e3ba673e7218a17451e2e644a112d38c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dkoenawan/design-patterns-of-everything/git/commits/b38706610afdfc4ca65dbf9fc6b741d692914f24","verification":{"payload":"tree ce8c114e3ba673e7218a17451e2e644a112d38c3\nparent 94935d6f137000962ef48dc977cdf181c27c07e4\nauthor Daniel Koenawan <daniel.k.koenawan@gmail.com> 1790777177 +0000\ncommitter Daniel Koenawan <daniel.k.koenawan@gmail.com> 1790777177 +0000\n\nfix: TrafficCutoverViz canvas colours — hex ink for mote glow, literal gold for router box\n\nUnrouted motes used an rgba() colour, so the glow''s `${color}50` alpha\nsuffix produced an unparseable colour and addColorStop threw intermittently.\nGOLD_TINT was ''var(--gold)'', which canvas silently ignores.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg9FjGzSnDqeeY6slcWpdEDeVWg/\njnHuwoaR7uu5cOX3oAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQGwCMriNg7a3sNqnxqEvDhOcYJNQFbi9FsN2UeI2cVZPkL9qi8NeZkyIugJS8xeIc6\ndnzengLKhGPhsuOSFWOAQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T14:06:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90543613?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkoenawan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkoenawan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkoenawan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkoenawan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkoenawan","id":90543613,"login":"dkoenawan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTQzNjEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkoenawan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkoenawan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api