d to Schema-Driven Validation\n\nBefore/after comparison of scattered imperative if-checks vs. a single\ndeclarative schema (safeParse) that is both the type source and the\nvalidation contract; brings Data Pipeline to 3/4 Sandpack coverage\n(Medallion Architecture, Pure Functions, Schema-Driven Validation).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e37dd11ecb8788c17425d910e780aa79968d9582","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dkoenawan/design-patterns-of-everything/git/trees/e37dd11ecb8788c17425d910e780aa79968d9582"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dkoenawan/design-patterns-of-everything/git/commits/bf71065b53546994f34be52d71cc969d8f1dbaf0","verification":{"payload":"tree e37dd11ecb8788c17425d910e780aa79968d9582\nparent a1d4c7e2a270dec74b39db2c6a684e4d07f15cd5\nauthor Daniel Koenawan <daniel.k.koenawan@gmail.com> 1789999283 +0000\ncommitter Daniel Koenawan <daniel.k.koenawan@gmail.com> 1789999283 +0000\n\nfeat: add Sandpack playground to Schema-Driven Validation\n\nBefore/after comparison of scattered imperative if-checks vs. a single\ndeclarative schema (safeParse) that is both the type source and the\nvalidation contract; brings Data Pipeline to 3/4 Sandpack coverage\n(Medallion Architecture, Pure Functions, Schema-Driven Validation).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg9FjGzSnDqeeY6slcWpdEDeVWg/\njnHuwoaR7uu5cOX3oAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQFKxf6M7tQF4lagciHDJdFXYzL5P68CoXtUNwuE9gEtquOBfwxLrhRCn/aDkYebAZA\n0t0N62PsfhwUMG3uNoTg8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-21T14:01:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90543613?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkoenawan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkoenawan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/