ite_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commits/aa1f364788df8f06d3f66c1d493b90f124db3328/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T05:52:08Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T05:52:08Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"In-part search: match like the extended search (maqaf = space)\n\nThe in-part search deleted the Hebrew maqaf along with the niqqud, so\n\"עֵץ־חַיִּים\" became \"עץחיים\" and a search for \"עץ חיים\" missed it (19\nof the 24 occurrences in the siddur are maqaf-joined). It now uses the\nsame normalisation as the extended search: niqqud, cantillation and\nHTML ignored, maqaf treated as a space, repeated spaces collapsed. It\nalso searches the reference field, as the extended search does.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CgXeCub2KvAEu45LfGsz8b","tree":{"sha":"b884e5197706c8982caf41696e00d4255f49ed40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/git/trees/b884e5197706c8982caf41696e00d4255f49ed40"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/git/commits/aa1f364788df8f06d3f66c1d493b90f124db3328","verification":{"payload":"tree b884e5197706c8982caf41696e00d4255f49ed40\nparent b552c01b4fcf9d5d53dbe80bed7a6a913edbc9b7\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791438728 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791438728 +0000\n\nIn-part search: match like the extended search (maqaf = space)\n\nThe in-part search deleted the Hebrew maqaf along with the niqqud, so\n\"עֵץ־חַיִּים\" became \"עץחיים\" and a search for \"עץ חיים\" missed it (19\nof the 24 occurrences in the