70ce4104daaaeb43a12aac498ae9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T22:48:34Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T22:48:34Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"TOC editor: extended search across categories, translations and nusachim\n\nA new \"חיפוש מורחב\" button in the top bar opens a search over every\ncategory and prayer of the current translation, with options to widen\nit to all translations and/or all nusachim. Matching ignores niqqud,\ncantillation, HTML and maqaf; results show the full location and\nhighlight the match in the pointed text. Clicking a result navigates\nto the part and marks the item (re-using the in-part search).\n\nItems are loaded per translation/prayer and cached for the session\n(15 min TTL, manual refresh, current prayer invalidated on open).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CgXeCub2KvAEu45LfGsz8b","tree":{"sha":"8b13d1ecead4ae33a9138bcb58c3bfbcdf1e7863","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/git/trees/8b13d1ecead4ae33a9138bcb58c3bfbcdf1e7863"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/git/commits/ce1f30910c0370ce4104daaaeb43a12aac498ae9","verification":{"payload":"tree 8b13d1ecead4ae33a9138bcb58c3bfbcdf1e7863\nparent 8b4e6c1fc564cf8f8202eafa31490746db962751\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791413314 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791413314 +0000\n\nTOC editor: extended search across categories, translations and nusachim\n\nA new \"חיפוש מורחב\" button in the top bar opens a search over every\ncategory and prayer of the current translation, with options to widen\nit to all translations and/or all nusachim. Matching ignores niqqud,\ncantillation, HTML and maqaf; results show the full location and\nhighlight the match in the pointed text. Clicking a result navigates\nto the part and marks the item (re-using the in-part search).\n\nItems are loaded per translation/prayer and cached for the session\n(15 min TTL, manual refresh, current prayer invalidated on open).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CgXeCub2KvAEu45LfGsz8b\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAbjjtpO\nHkIdgwUKgl2H3wfXgi2Vdv7w882DYQKspKNCIfnMBbf2iGGZcSkeWf9B0hnTHzPEOJHTQfGm7xlf\nIQ4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T22:48:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commit/ce1f30910c0370ce4104daaaeb43a12aac498ae9","node_id":"C_kwDORN37UdoAKGNlMWYzMDkxMGMwMzcwY2U0MTA0ZGFhYWViNDNhMTJhYWM0OThhZTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commit/8b4e6c1fc564cf8f8202eafa31490746db962751","sha":"8b4e6c1fc564cf8f8202eafa31490746db962751","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kor