tps://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commits/47c0f798391d3559efc53d5f1842bfc3ab77b516/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T13:18:02Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T13:18:02Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Warehouse: save several items as one entry (multi-select)\n\nAdds a \"בחירה מרובה למחסן\" mode to the base-nusach item list: a checkbox per\nrow, select all/none, and \"שמור N במחסן\", which stores the selected items\nand their linked translations as a single warehouse entry. Pasting that\nentry inserts all items as a block in itemId order via the existing\ncopyItemsToPart path (which already supported multiple items).\n\n- buildWarehouseEntryFromRows: multi-row builder (sorted by itemId, label\n  \"N פריטים: ...\", a translation linked to several selected items is\n  stored once so it is not copied twice); buildWarehouseEntryFromRow now\n  delegates to it.\n- usePartEdit: saveBaseItemsToWarehouse; the single-item save uses it.\n- Warehouse panel and paste modal show the item count for multi-item\n  entries; paste-modal search matches any item in the entry.\n- Tests: builder ordering/dedup, and an end-to-end paste of a multi-item\n  entry through copyItemsToPart.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EHY633Ggeh49zLULkdpPFo","tree":{"sha":"18a1702dd14c816e8be902d5db418a0d64b00023","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/git/trees/18a1702dd14c816e8be902d5db418a0d64b00023"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/git/commits/47c0f798391d3559efc53d5f1842bfc3ab77b516","verification":{"payload":"tree 18a1702dd14c816e8be902d5db418a0d64b00023\nparent 4764f1f6b38185701c017734bd9cdb109b7f658e\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791292682 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791292682 +0000\n\nWarehouse: save several items as one entry (multi-select)\n\nAdds a \"בחירה מרובה למחסן\" mode to the base-nusach item list: a checkbox per\nrow, select all/none, and \"שמור N במחסן\", which stores the selected items\nand their linked translations as a single warehouse entry. Pasting that\nentry inserts all items as a block in itemId order via the existing\ncopyItemsToPart path (which already supported multiple items).\n\n- buildWarehouseEntryFromRows: multi-row builder (sorted by itemId, label\n  \"N פריטים: ...\", a translation linked to several selected items is\n  stored once so it is not copied twice); buildWarehouseEntryFromRow now\n  delegates to it.\n- usePartEdit: saveBaseItemsToWarehouse; the single-item save uses it.\n- Warehouse panel and paste modal show the item count for multi-item\n  entries; paste-modal search matches any item in the entry.\n- Tests: builder ordering/dedup, and an end-to-end paste of a multi-item\n  entry through copyItemsToPart.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EHY633Ggeh49zLULkdpPFo\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQIemXBbp\nzwrfW9V04fFKOjAiDomYKlhwVBQhF+8QFfdkYJt9kj/nEJZk5KzmqLOKuaJ18o5rL+uNMdSaeKqx\nzQE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T13:18:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id