8185701c017734bd9cdb109b7f658e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/189559236?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/malka4325","id":189559236,"login":"malka4325","node_id":"U_kgDOC0xxxA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commits/d5c349ac96eaa7693c7fae251e4eb7c07e369904/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:49:09Z","email":"m0583257174@gmail.com","name":"malka4325"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:49:09Z","email":"m0583257174@gmail.com","name":"malka4325"},"message":"Update an existing date set in place, published to every nusach\n\nSome date sets carry wrong dates. Until now the only option was \"find or\ncreate\", which gives the current item a different set and never fixes the\nset itself. Editors can now update a set in place from the date-set modal.\n\nBefore saving, a review screen shows exactly what will happen:\n- the changed fields, before and after\n- the days the set will apply, before and after, for Israel and abroad,\n  from today to the end of next Hebrew year. This uses a port of the app''s\n  engine (src/engine/dateSet.ts). Checked against the app on all 559\n  bundled sets, day by day over 5786-5788: 0 mismatches.\n- every item and part using the set, per nusach (stage scan)\n- the publish steps, stating that only this set is published\nThe editor confirms with a checkbox that names the real counts.\n\nSaving uses a transaction with an optimistic lock on the timestamp. The\ndoc is fully replaced; fields the form doesn''t manage are kept. ID 100\nand deleted sets are blocked. Publishing copies the doc to prod with a\nfresh timestamp and bumps db-update-time.maxTimestamp plus Bagel for every\nnusach on stage and prod. A partial failure can be retried safely. Each\nupdate is logged with the full before/after docs for restore.\n\nAlso fixes the shared form dropping false flags: abroad=false (\"Israel\nonly\") and similar came back as \"no condition\" (153 such flags in the\ndata). Flags are now three-way: no condition, yes, no.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9f0c9df10d386e6335ca5f5e25af7cbf1dea79a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/git/trees/9f0c9df10d386e6335ca5f5e25af7cbf1dea79a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/git/commits/d5c349ac96eaa7693c7fae251e4eb7c07e369904","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/189559236?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/malka4325","id":189559236,"login":"malka4325","node_id":"U_kgDOC0xxxA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/repos","site_