rs/malka4325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/malka4325","id":189559236,"login":"malka4325","node_id":"U_kgDOC0xxxA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commits/d745930a77d5bc5257be6bd3d4af3c682a0c6e3a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T14:52:34Z","email":"m0583257174@gmail.com","name":"malka4325"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T14:52:34Z","email":"m0583257174@gmail.com","name":"malka4325"},"message":"Warn when an item''s date rule is deleted or missing\n\nA calendar entry with deleted:true never passes in the app, so every item\npointing at it is hidden on every date — but the CMS showed it as a normal\ndate restriction. That is how the Hoshana of 16 Tishrei on a Sunday (651)\ndisappeared on Sukkot 5787: the data script wrote it as deleted on\n2026-05-17 and nothing in the CMS said so.\n\n- The \"מוגבל לתאריכים\" badge turns red (\"תנאי תאריך מחוק\" / \"תנאי תאריך\n  לא קיים\") when the entry is deleted or absent, with the reason in the\n  tooltip. Shared DateSetBadge replaces the two inline copies.\n- The date filter skips deleted entries, matching what the app shows.\n- findMatchingDateSetId no longer reuses a deleted entry for a new item;\n  getNextDateSetId still counts it, so its id is not handed out again.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>