laude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commits/190c612d49eeee7457751ae92824c22f057da642/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T14:32:48Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T14:32:48Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Tanakh LaMetayel: rank the entry picker''s matches, best first\n\nThe picker for related entries and redirects showed the first eight\nmatches in id order. Matching is deliberately lenient about full and\ndefective spelling, so \"שור\" also matches תאשור, נשר, שרון, אשור and a\ndozen others, and the entry actually called שור fell off the list. An\neditor had to know its id to pick it.\n\nqueryRank scores a match: exact name, name starting with the query, a\nword starting with it, contains, then the same three in defective\nspelling. rankEntries sorts by that score and keeps the original order\nwithin a tier. matchesQuery is unchanged in what it accepts. The picker\nnow shows twelve, best first, and says how many more there are.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KQbfoWmjDCxKQQBW2gbv4E","tree":{"sha":"d83b1d311ebb0180180621ab45036e76e982040c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/git/trees/d83b1d311ebb0180180621ab45036e76e982040c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/git/commits/190c612d49eeee7457751ae92824c22f057da642","verification":{"payload":"tree d83b1d311ebb0180180621ab45036e76e982040c\nparent 1efaeeaf56fda88338d1726d98c2b6af2697ef07\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790087568 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790087568 +0000\n\nTanakh LaMetayel: rank the entry picker''s matches, best first\n\nThe picker for related entries and redirects showed the first eight\nmatches in id order. Matching is deliberately lenient about full and\ndefective spelling, so \"שור\" also matches תאשור, נשר, שרון, אשור and a\ndozen others, and the entry actually called שור fell off the list. An\neditor had to know its id to pick it.\n\nqueryRank scores a match: exact name, name starting with the query, a\nword starting with it, contains, then the same three in defective\nspelling. rankEntries sorts by that score and keeps the original order\nwithin a tier. matchesQuery is unchanged in what it accepts. The picker\nnow shows twelve, best first, and says how many more there are.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KQbfoWmjDCxKQQBW2gbv4E\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMp0dQO1\nkckfHzXztB4Q14Ma37MfS26Ag+V+K2QXDSZv1Cg2s85/sTxnWE+lJri+1aLj+R3ej0Wq1/+zU/dO\nGAU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-22T14:32:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.gith