,"subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commit/6516415e0c08d032385304b0bb724feb39885505","node_id":"C_kwDORN37UdoAKDY1MTY0MTVlMGMwOGQwMzIzODUzMDRiMGJiNzI0ZmViMzk4ODU1MDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commit/efc301ea335fd4800e78635bbd7f767f1e808410","sha":"efc301ea335fd4800e78635bbd7f767f1e808410","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commits/efc301ea335fd4800e78635bbd7f767f1e808410"}],"sha":"6516415e0c08d032385304b0bb724feb39885505","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commits/6516415e0c08d032385304b0bb724feb39885505"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commits/efc301ea335fd4800e78635bbd7f767f1e808410/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T12:41:30Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T12:41:30Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Tanakh LaMetayel: recover the five entries lost in the PDF extraction\n\nChecking the published pack against the guide''s printed tables of\ncontents (all eight subjects, ~560 entries) found five entries missing:\nעץ, עזה, עכו, ארם נהרים and לוח העמים. In each the PDF reader failed to\nrecognise the entry heading, glued the body onto the previous entry, and\nthe later clean-up deleted the \"foreign\" text instead of splitting it.\n\n- scripts/tanakh/recovery/missing-entries.csv: the five entries in the\n  sheet''s column layout, proof-read against the PDF pages, every\n  reference validated against tanakhIndex.json. README explains how to\n  load them and lists the follow-up edits to existing entries.\n- scripts/tanakh/checkToc.py + toc/guide-toc.txt: the printed tables of\n  contents transcribed, and a check that reports what the pack lacks.\n  Run after each publish.\n- public/tanakh-media: thumbnails for the four Table of Nations images\n  added to the app.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KQbfoWmjDCxKQQBW2gbv4E","tree":{"sha":"39c24602d9c9fec7ab0a50dffaa1cf4e88bd5fff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/git/trees/39c24602d9c9fec7ab0a50dffaa1cf4e88bd5fff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/git/commits/efc301ea335fd4800e78635bbd7f767f1e808410","verification":{"payload":"tree 39c24602d9c9fec7ab0a50dffaa1cf4e88bd5fff\nparent 062b225181d5a56867837872bbb2b08afde25c56\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790080890 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790080890 +0000\n\nTanakh LaMetayel: recover the five entries lost in the PDF extraction\n\nChecking the published pack against the guide''s printed tables of\ncontents (all eight subjects, ~560 entries) found five entries missing:\nעץ, עזה, עכו, ארם נהרים and לוח העמים. In each the PDF reader failed to\nrecognise the entry heading, glued the body onto the previous entry, and\nthe later clean-up deleted the \"foreign\" text instead of splitting it.\n\n- scripts/tanakh/recovery/missing-entries.csv: the five entries in the\n  sheet''s column layout, proof-read against the PDF pages, every\n  reference validated against tanakhIndex.json. README explains how to\n  load them and lists the follow-up edits to existing entries.\n- scripts/tanakh/checkToc.py + toc/guide-toc.txt: the printed tables of\n  contents transcribed, and a check that reports what the pack lacks.\n  Run after each publish.\n- public/tanakh-media: thumbnails for the four Table of Nations images\n  added to the app.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KQbfoWmjDCxKQQBW2gbv4E\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQLSAhjoY\n98hW4KAggYc+JhNcVVuAR7kx2uCdOZix9zxipHz2miy6IUjSrp/NHiT/oRfdhGrFd2WBihOKYeyS\nRw4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-22T12:41:33Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users