ace/AppKorenCMS/commits/da395157561ef9781ddb76f1fe057398f045701e"}],"sha":"6dcc201aa31eeca3dc5a0589f70482bb23995ab3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commits/6dcc201aa31eeca3dc5a0589f70482bb23995ab3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commits/da395157561ef9781ddb76f1fe057398f045701e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T15:39:04Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T15:39:04Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Tanakh LaMetayel: build the app content pack (stage 7)\n\nConverts the entries in Firestore into one ContentPack shaped the way the\napp reads it — categories, entries, anchors, locations — with a format\nnumber so an old app can refuse a pack it does not understand, and a\nversion that lets it skip a download when nothing changed.\n\nVerses stay references. The Tanakh text is already baked into the app\n(5MB); duplicating it into the pack, or dragging it into the CMS to inline\nit at publish time, buys nothing. It also means English verses can later\ncome from an English Tanakh without touching this format. That is a change\nfrom the original note, which had the text pulled at publish time.\n\nTwo channels: live carries only visible entries, preview carries the hidden\nones too so an editor can check an entry in the app before showing it.\n\nA validation error in an entry that would ship blocks the build. A\ncross-reference or redirect pointing at a hidden or missing entry only\nwarns — that is a normal state mid-edit, and the link is simply left out.\n\nUpload waits for Storage (Blaze), so the file downloads to the editor''s\nmachine for now, which is enough to confirm it is right. When Storage is\nenabled it is one function in publishService plus an env flag; the\nconversion, the screen, meta/publish and the whole app side are unchanged.\n\nDisabled buttons now dim: inline styles get no :disabled from CSS, and a\nbutton that is always disabled today read as clickable.\n\nVerified in a browser against the harness: the pack builds, both channels\ndownload, the preview file carries the hidden entry and the live one does\nnot, categories map to their numeric ids, verses come out as references,\nand both expected warnings appear.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013S5f5PMiDgEfYaPY2y9vaj","tree":{"sha":"90600a8910a175ed44fe5baadcc9e651a9b1310d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/git/trees/90600a8910a175ed44fe5baadcc9e651a9b1310d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/git/commits/da395157561ef9781ddb76f1fe057398f045701e","verification":{"payload":"tree 90600a8910a175ed44fe5baadcc9e651a9b1310d\nparent 2ed79ba49d8c7dd022d6662b852364ee9cff9b40\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789573144 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789573144 +0000\n\nTanakh LaMetayel: build the app content pack (stage 7)\n\nConverts the entries in Firestore into one ContentPack shaped the way the\napp reads it — categories, entries, anchors, locations — with a format\nnumber so an old app can refuse a pack it does not understand, and a\nversion that lets it skip a download when nothing changed.\n\nVerses stay references. The Tanakh text is already baked into the app\n(5MB); duplicating it into the pack, or dragging it into the CMS to inline\nit at publish time, buys nothing. It also means English verses can later\ncome from an English Tanakh without touching this format. That is a change\nfrom the original note, which had the text pulled at publish time.\n\nTwo channels: live carries only visible entries, preview carries the hidden\nones too so an editor can check an entry in the app before showing it.\n\nA validation error in an entry that would ship blocks the build. A\ncross-reference or redirect pointing at a hidden or missing entry only\nwarns — that is a normal state mid-edit, and the link is simply left out.\n\nUpload waits for Storage (Blaze), so the file downloads to the editor''s\nmachine for now, which is enough to confirm it is right. When Storage is\nenabled it is one function in publishService plus an env flag; the\nconversion, the screen, meta/publish and the whole app side are unchanged.\n\nDisabled buttons now dim: inline styles get no :disabled from CSS, and a\nbutton that is always disabled today read as clickable.\n\nVerified in a browser against the harness: the pack builds, both channels\ndownload, the preview file carries the hidden entry and the live one does\nnot, categories map to their numeric ids, verses come out as references,\nand both expected warnings appear.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013S5f5PMiDgEfYaPY2y9vaj\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1