ntry, not a place\n\nThe tooltip pinned next to the marker showed the entry title alone, which\nsits on the map like an OSM place label and was read as the name of the\nlocation under the pin — a name that then never changed when the pin moved.\nPrefixing it with \"ערך:\" says what it is.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013S5f5PMiDgEfYaPY2y9vaj","tree":{"sha":"4fd7514a9b3c3a8f0eab0a6cf899843af0852c88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/git/trees/4fd7514a9b3c3a8f0eab0a6cf899843af0852c88"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/git/commits/3339b588067352c777dff1c95607fe41b438f227","verification":{"payload":"tree 4fd7514a9b3c3a8f0eab0a6cf899843af0852c88\nparent 34eda13565e350cab856661cc1447bc7a43523e8\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789570941 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789570941 +0000\n\nTanakh LaMetayel: label the map marker as the entry, not a place\n\nThe tooltip pinned next to the marker showed the entry title alone, which\nsits on the map like an OSM place label and was read as the name of the\nlocation under the pin — a name that then never changed when the pin moved.\nPrefixing it with \"ערך:\" says what it is.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013S5f5PMiDgEfYaPY2y9vaj\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQDNxSsUT\nZdRMCa6U8Xmqe3Cv6fXijomhFUe0Wje7l9v5wfY3GonCzO6KRc/sJ5NCX31lidIlc5PFkOblj7XO\nnwQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-16T15:02:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commit/3339b588067352c777dff1c95607fe41b438f227","node_id":"C_kwDORN37UdoAKDMzMzliNTg4MDY3MzUyYzc3N2RmZjFjOTU2MDdmZTQxYjQzOGYyMjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commit/34eda13565e350cab856661cc1447bc7a43523e8","sha":"34eda13565e350cab856661cc1447bc7a43523e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commits/34eda13565e350cab856661cc1447bc7a43523e8"}],"sha":"3339b588067352c777dff1c95607fe41b438f227","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commits/3339b588067352c777dff1c95607fe41b438f227"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commits/34eda13565e350cab856661cc1447bc7a43523e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T14:36:07Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T15:01:50Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Tanakh LaMetayel: read the map in Hebrew — place name, search, satellite\n\nOSM labels are in each place''s own language, so an entry in Lebanon, Syria\nor Egypt showed the editor Arabic with no way to tell what was under the\npin. The tiles have no language switch, so give the editor three ways to\nidentify a place instead.\n\n- The point''s name, in Hebrew, under the map (Nominatim reverse, at\n  settlement zoom, falling back to English).\n- Place search by name in Hebrew or English; picking a result moves the pin\n  and the view.\n- A satellite layer (Esri World Imagery) with no labels at all, for\n  confirming a tell or ruin by eye.\n\nNominatim allows one request per second: the point lookup is debounced by\n800ms and aborted while the pin keeps moving, and search runs only on\ndemand. An unavailable service is a message, never a block — same rule the\nmap itself already followed.\n\nVerified in a browser with the service stubbed: the readout resolves to\n\"מרג׳ עיון, נבטייה, לבנון\", the layer button swaps OSM tiles for Esri, and\npicking a search result sets the coordinates. No console errors.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013S5f5PMiDgEfYaPY2y9vaj","tree":{"sha":"a95375ec66848ec8e876590d938df4162cf17127","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/git/trees/a95375ec66848ec8e876590d938df4162cf17127"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/git/commits/34eda13565e350cab856661cc1447bc7a43523e8","verification":{"payload":"tree a95375ec66848ec8e876590d938df4162cf17127\nparent 25f2cec6224d938439770bd8e85c5f9fd928cba0\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789569367 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789570910 +0000\n\nTanakh LaMetayel: read the map in Hebrew — place name, search, satellite\n\nOSM labels are in each place''s own language, so an entry in Lebanon, Syria\nor Egypt showed the editor Arabic with no way to tell what was under the\npin. The tiles have no language switch, so give the editor three ways to\nidentify a place instead.\n\n- The point''s name, in Hebrew, under the map (Nominatim reverse, at\n  settlement zoom, falling back to English).\n- Place search by name in Hebrew or English; picking a result moves the pin\n  and the view.\n- A satellite layer (Esri World Imagery) with no labels at all, for\n  confirming a tell or ruin by eye.\n\nNominatim allows one request per second: the point lookup is debounced by\n800ms and aborted while the pin keeps moving, and search runs only on\ndemand. An unavailable service is a message, never a block — same rule the\nmap itself already followed.\n\nVerified in a browser with the service stubbed: the readout resolves to\n\"מרג׳ עיון, נבטייה, לבנון\", the layer button swaps OSM tiles for Esri, and\npicking a search result sets the coordinates. No console errors.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013S5f5PMiDgEfYaPY2y9vaj\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQB7NSr02\nKl+btuOQRcgabJUefaWEZf8eSSUQ2HNp/XArEH8A/Aqf/hHMCl1w6vHP5gY0GR+BXnfSWsABdquA\nPAM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-16T15:02:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commit/34eda13565e350cab856661cc1447bc7a43523e8","node_id":"C_kwDORN37UdoAKDM0ZWRhMTM1NjVlMzUwY2FiODU2NjYxY2MxNDQ3YmM3YTQzNTIzZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commit/25f2cec6224d938439770bd8e85c5f9fd928cba0","sha":"25f2cec6224d938439770bd8e85c5f9fd928cba0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commits/25f2cec6224d938439770bd8e85c5f9fd928cba0"}],"sha":"34eda13565e350cab856661cc1447bc7a43523e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commits/34eda13565e350cab856661cc1447bc7a43523e8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/189559236?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.