MS/commit/44a2b948c46b62df7a5708a49b51c613636529e0","node_id":"C_kwDORN37UdoAKDQ0YTJiOTQ4YzQ2YjYyZGY3YTU3MDhhNDliNTFjNjEzNjM2NTI5ZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commit/f3818715fd5f30c669e18f2967af133bf6d9c44f","sha":"f3818715fd5f30c669e18f2967af133bf6d9c44f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commits/f3818715fd5f30c669e18f2967af133bf6d9c44f"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commit/cbf3c3f205b3af4d489b6726f64ec1d08e7982e6","sha":"cbf3c3f205b3af4d489b6726f64ec1d08e7982e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commits/cbf3c3f205b3af4d489b6726f64ec1d08e7982e6"}],"sha":"44a2b948c46b62df7a5708a49b51c613636529e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commits/44a2b948c46b62df7a5708a49b51c613636529e0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commits/cbf3c3f205b3af4d489b6726f64ec1d08e7982e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T11:39:34Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T11:39:34Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Tanakh LaMetayel: fix the 13 mis-assigned e0516 anchors in migration\n\ne0516 \"לוח העמים\" has no content at all (no text, no images) and so does\nnot migrate. Thirteen of its fifteen verse anchors are Edom/Se''ir verses\nthat belong to e0517 \"אֱדוֹם, שֵׂעִיר\"; without a fix they would simply\ndisappear, and today they lead to a blank page in the app.\n\nanchorFixes.ts holds a manual fix table applied to the anchor map before\nanchors are grouped by entry: twelve move to e0517 (three of them also to\nthe verse that actually mentions Edom, since they were attached to the\npsalm''s superscription), and Yehoshua 15:10 is dropped — its \"הר שעיר\" is\nthe hill on Yehuda''s border near Kesalon, not Edom''s Se''ir. The remaining\ntwo anchors (Divrei HaYamim I 1:4, 1:28) really are Table of Nations\nverses and go down with the entry.\n\nThis is a data fix only: anchors.json in the app repo is untouched. A fix\nwith no matching anchor is reported, not fatal. The report now lists every\nfix applied.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013S5f5PMiDgEfYaPY2y9vaj","tree":{"sha":"8238b3dfe2cbd33d375083e03141499902e1b50e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/git/trees/8238b3dfe2cbd33d375083e03141499902e1b50e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/git/commits/cbf3c3f205b3af4d489b6726f64ec1d08e7982e6","verification":{"payload":"tree 8238b3dfe2cbd33d375083e03141499902e1b50e\nparent f3818715fd5f30c669e18f2967af133bf6d9c44f\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789558774 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789558774 +0000\n\nTanakh LaMetayel: fix the 13 mis-assigned e0516 anchors in migration\n\ne0516 \"לוח העמים\" has no content at all (no text, no images) and so does\nnot migrate. Thirteen of its fifteen verse anchors are Edom/Se''ir verses\nthat belong to e0517 \"אֱדוֹם, שֵׂעִיר\"; without a fix they would simply\ndisappear, and today they lead to a blank page in the app.\n\nanchorFixes.ts holds a manual fix table applied to the anchor map before\nanchors are grouped by entry: twelve move to e0517 (three of them also to\nthe verse that actually mentions Edom, since they were attached to the\npsalm''s superscription), and Yehoshua 15:10 is dropped — its \"הר שעיר\" is\nthe hill on Yehuda''s border near Kesalon, not Edom''s Se''ir. The remaining\ntwo anchors (Divrei HaYamim I 1:4, 1:28) really are Table of Nations\nverses and go down with the entry.\n\nThis is a data fix only: anchors.json in the app repo is untouched. A fix\nwith no matching anchor is reported, not fatal. The report now lists every\nfix applied.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013S5f5PMiDgEfYaPY2y9vaj\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMHsJxjc\nqCjkmn+MxovM/VNp5PDFakLLs0QYXzQ+8TLmOOnUgPjQsEmatA+TFAp88aacMEk4VCv9jaQpzAcx\nPAM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-16T11:39:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"st