pi.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commits/7b8d784b385fb1e80ae3096080234049aa24f68f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T05:18:56Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T05:18:56Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Tanakh LaMetayel: migration script from the Google Sheet (stage 3)\n\nAdds scripts/tanakh/migrate.ts, a one-off script that reads the live\n\"ערכים\" sheet, converts it to the new model and writes it to the Tanakh\nFirestore project. Report-only by default; --write performs the writes\nand never overwrites existing entries unless --overwrite is given.\n\nModel additions used by the script:\n\n- fromSheet.ts: CSV parsing and column mapping ported from the app''s\n  sheet.ts. Bracketed verse references (\"[יהושע יח, א] text\") are parsed\n  into references instead of being dropped; the Notes column is read.\n  Rows with a title but no id can be assigned one via idForRow.\n- quoteResolver.ts: resolves a quoted verse to book/chapter/verse by\n  text, tolerant to nikud, cantillation, maqaf, the abbreviated divine\n  name and \"...\" omissions, including multi-verse ranges. Only unique\n  matches are accepted.\n- Entry.notes for internal editor notes; entry ids may contain dots\n  (the sheet has ids like e0216.1).\n\nDry run on the current sheet: 835 entries (101 rows had no id; 98 of\nthem are new places the app currently skips), 426 locations, 658 verse\nquotes as references (60 resolved by text), 0 validation errors.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011enfES8cCygECGBSr5nsas","tree":{"sha":"45e8471f6c256ac2137d716c85602f94aa7117fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/git/trees/45e8471f6c256ac2137d716c85602f94aa7117fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/git/commits/7b8d784b385fb1e80ae3096080234049aa24f68f","verification":{"payload":"tree 45e8471f6c256ac2137d716c85602f94aa7117fe\nparent 24893a207c049cc0f058ae3e6c087b15855096fc\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789535936 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789535936 +0000\n\nTanakh LaMetayel: migration script from the Google Sheet (stage 3)\n\nAdds scripts/tanakh/migrate.ts, a one-off script that reads the live\n\"ערכים\" sheet, converts it to the new model and writes it to the Tanakh\nFirestore project. Report-only by default; --write performs the writes\nand never overwrites existing entries unless --overwrite is given.\n\nModel additions used by the script:\n\n- fromSheet.ts: CSV parsing and column mapping ported from the app''s\n  sheet.ts. Bracketed verse references (\"[יהושע יח, א] text\") are parsed\n  into references instead of being dropped; the Notes column is read.\n  Rows with a title but no id can be assigned one via idForRow.\n- quoteResolver.ts: resolves a quoted verse to book/chapter/verse by\n  text, tolerant to nikud, cantillation, maqaf, the abbreviated divine\n  name and \"...\" omissions, including multi-verse ranges. Only unique\n  matches are accepted.\n- Entry.notes for internal editor notes; entry ids may contain dots\n  (the sheet has ids like e0216.1).\n\nDry run on the current sheet: 835 entries (101 rows had no id; 98 of\nthem are new places the app currently skips), 426 locations, 658 verse\nquotes as references (60 resolved by text), 0 validation errors.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011enfES8cCygECGBSr5nsas\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQLDHh5Wi\ncrItTinUe1+/cZYNmdsmODCiHjOugydlyoCDTcZwIkYqUX0l31rL8iB7uvMjyw6ltXYo/NIvcBjy\nvAg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE