/users/malka4325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/malka4325","id":189559236,"login":"malka4325","node_id":"U_kgDOC0xxxA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/malka4325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commits/5547df0f223e684e493b9fc14de8334b392cb129/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T11:43:56Z","email":"m0583257174@gmail.com","name":"malka4325"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T11:43:56Z","email":"m0583257174@gmail.com","name":"malka4325"},"message":"Replace the catalog collection with a stage/prod screen like app-flags\n\nA plain Firecms collection edits only the CMS''s primary connection, which\nis stage everywhere (locally and on Vercel), so the prod catalog could not\nbe edited from it. \"קטלוג תוספות\" is now a custom view in the pattern of\napp-flags and coupons: env switch, prod password, confirm before a prod\nsave, delete behind a typed confirmation.\n\ncatalogService writes the document shape the app parses (empty fields\nabsent, tracks with id/rank/type/url), keeps the Bagel provenance fields\non rewrite, and refuses what the app could not show (bad storeId, missing\nEnglish title, malformed color, incomplete track). Round trip is tested.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"86b91f17eeb55a98ce6