"received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commits/2b7630be341d782f50cd11d9ce7976172edc083e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T12:02:09Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T12:02:09Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Record failed publishes in the change log\n\nBoth publish flows logged only successes, so a publish that failed\nmid-way left no trace of who attempted it or why it failed.\n\nA failed stage publish (publish_to_bagel) or prod publish\n(publish_to_prod) now writes an entry with publishedToBagel: false and\nthe error message; the change-log view shows these rows with status\n\"נכשל\" and the error text as the summary. A prod publish that fails\nafter partially copying docs is safe to log as failed: the reconcile\nanchor did not advance, so the next publish completes the remainder.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YQot967runiNSpUoyLiAje","tree":{"sha":"201654436c85d073c00695e2c1cff4ee4ce11f12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/git/trees/201654436c85d073c00695e2c1cff4ee4ce11f12"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/git/commits/2b7630be341d782f50cd11d9ce7976172edc083e","verification":{"payload":"tree 201654436c85d073c00695e2c1cff4ee4ce11f12\nparent f9fc4fad95c6151d98ea4d02d51aa56ec347fe48\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788264129 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788264129 +0000\n\nRecord failed publishes in the change log\n\nBoth publish flows logged only successes, so a publish that failed\nmid-way left no trace of who attempted it or why it failed.\n\nA failed stage publish (publish_to_bagel) or prod publish\n(publish_to_prod) now writes an entry with publishedToBagel: false and\nthe error message; the change-log view shows these rows with status\n\"נכשל\" and the error text as the summary. A prod publish that fails\nafter partially copying docs is safe to log as failed: the reconcile\nanchor did not advance, so the next publish completes the remainder.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YQot967runiNSpUoyLiAje\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEqGZ7gb\npp6b62+kzOe/WMY092Dv1BdCRz0im5UN+T9GkQ4staDe8AEbu5kkRymfNeqTliO1xJNNv1skq89+\n4wE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-01T12:02:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commit/2b7630be341d782f50cd11d9ce7976172edc083e","node_id":"C_kwDORN37UdoAKDJiNzYzMGJlMzQxZDc4MmY1MGNkMTFkOWNlNzk3NjE3MmVkYzA4M2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commit/f9fc4fad95c6151d98ea4d02d51aa56ec347fe48","sha":"f9fc4fad95c6151d98ea4d02d51aa56ec347fe48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commits/f9fc4fad95c6151d98ea4d02d51aa56ec347fe48"}],"sha":"2b7630be341d782f50cd11d9ce7976172edc083e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commits/2b7630be341d782f50cd11d9ce7976172edc083e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/commits/f9fc4fad95c6151d98ea4d02d51aa56ec347fe48/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T11:58:50Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T11:58:50Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Log prod publishes in the change log with reconcile results\n\n\"Publish to Prod\" - the operation that copies documents into the\nproduction database - wrote no change-log entry at all, so the log\ncould not answer who published to prod and when; and the existing\npublish_to_bagel rows did not say which environment they targeted\n(they are always the stage publish).\n\n- New publish_to_prod action, recorded from doPublishToProd with the\n  reconcile outcome: items/calendar/toc copied counts, how many docs\n  were skipped because prod was newer, and whether this was the first\n  full-comparison run.\n- The change-log view labels the two publishes distinctly (\"פרסום\n  לסטייג'' (Bagel)\" vs \"פרסום לפרוד\") and summarizes a prod publish row\n  as e.g. \"סונכרנו 183 מסמכים · השוואה מלאה ראשונה\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YQot967runiNSpUoyLiAje","tree":{"sha":"2bca7d43b6fa026b325e21e272238f6f292e97ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/git/trees/2bca7d43b6fa026b325e21e272238f6f292e97ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/koren-workspace/AppKorenCMS/git/commits/f9fc4fad95c6151d98ea4d02d51aa56ec347fe48","verification":{"payload":"tree 2bca7d43b6fa026b325e21e272238f6f292e97ef\nparent c71e2ea8fc666753674a6abf73ef2821ac06aa55\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788263930 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788263930 +0000\n\nLog prod publishes in the change log with reconcile results\n\n\"Publish to Prod\" - the operation that copies documents into the\nproduction database - wrote no change-log entry at all, so the log\ncould not answer who published to prod and when; and the existing\npublish_to_bagel rows did not say which environment they targeted\n(they are always the stage publish).\n\n- New publish_to_prod action, recorded from doPublishToProd with the\n  reconcile outcome: items/calendar/toc copied counts, how many docs\n  were skipped because prod was newer, and whether this was the first\n  full-comparison run.\n- The change-log v