1T15:56:14Z","email":"pradipyadavofficial26@gmail.com","name":"pradip"},"message":"Add initial project setup for React Interview Playground\n\n- Created essential project files including `package.json`, `package-lock.json`, and `.gitignore`.\n- Added main HTML entry point (`index.html`) and configured Vite for development.\n- Implemented the main application structure in `App.jsx` with lazy loading for different levels.\n- Established a basic CSS file for styling.\n- Introduced beginner-level playgrounds covering core React concepts such as JSX, state management, and component lifecycle.\n- Set up routing for different learning levels and topics.\n- Included a README with project goals, structure, and instructions for running the app.","tree":{"sha":"4d1159fd060decb519a9d6b01f0e7d6ac26defff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeepOfficial26/reactplayground/git/trees/4d1159fd060decb519a9d6b01f0e7d6ac26defff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeepOfficial26/reactplayground/git/commits/47d5760271d8a79f84ad5aa9b04b1aa68c7893aa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/156891849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeepOfficial26/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeepOfficial26/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeepOfficial26/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeepOfficial26/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DeepOfficial26","id":156891849,"login":"DeepOfficial26","node_id":"U_kgDOCVn6yQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeepOfficial26/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeepOfficial26/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeepOfficial26/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeepOfficial26/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscripti