rs/stepmikhaylov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rocketride-org/rocketride-server/commits/6ae5cd8616bacb76e5af9f7db3757bbac7472868/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:26:22Z","email":"stepmikhaylov@yandex.ru","name":"stepmik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:26:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(ci): skip test on non-main/stage/develop pr (#2488)\n\n* chore(ci): skip test on non-main/stage/develop pr\n\n* chore(ci): fail CI OK when a stacked PR built without tests; drop the edited/labeled triggers\n\nA run started by a title, description or label edit skips the build and\npasses CI OK, and with cancel-in-progress it also cancels the real run.\nCodeRabbit edits the description after every push, so that happened on\nthis PR. Instead, CI OK fails whenever the build ran without tests, which\nblocks a retargeted stacked PR until a push runs the suite.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015nTVr6jfSFYm1GppxbjghP\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Dmitrii Karataev <dmitrii.kataraev@rocketride.ai>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e1728f1ec554a436ee0c6939b28b838dba9e5f19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rocketride-org/rocketride-server/git/trees/e1728f1ec554a436ee0c6939b28b838dba9e5f19"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rocketride-org/rocketride-server/git/commits/6ae5cd8616bacb76e5af9f7db3757bbac7472868","verification":{"payload":"tree e1728f1ec554a436ee0c6939b28b838dba9e5f19\nparent 491e3be68e800098ec89c0ebf3aefa0342c7a4d9\nauthor stepmik <stepmikhaylov@yandex.ru> 1790947582 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790947582 +0200\n\nchore(ci): skip test on non-main/stage/develop pr (#2488)\n\n* chore(ci): skip test on non-main/stage/develop pr\n\n* chore(ci): fail CI OK when a stacked PR built without tests; drop the edited/labeled triggers\n\nA run started by a title, description or label edit skips the build and\npasses CI OK, and with cancel-in-progress it also cancels the real run.\nCodeRabbit edits the description after every push, so that happened on\nthis PR. Instead, CI OK fails whenever the build ran without tests, which\nblocks a retargeted stacked PR until a push runs the suite.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015nTVr6jfSFYm1GppxbjghP\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Dmitrii Karataev <dmitrii.kataraev@rocketride.ai>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv7D+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAeLsQAI1P8L0cjd6vnlwbwdxbvT8z\nRPvAs2mUcf+7Mz3960LRc3eg2cHkiL37sgoinA3+O8XZe6yqWdjnDESSO8th0Ov+\nieDU/J0ptjfo/S2ABL2pVYYv7Gq0maM2d3/16ifdnnChC130yxfgBTEQUr6xQf6N\nDmKkM1PMwdX1f+OF4BdgesED7tOt/7pG7t+7ni61oglk6xMtY2NoJtkWvkTzuTIr\nnS+X2T50gRrzJPOvyinyzftT7GCUGURrh3AymEbEtuuCxFqaHd1H68lmbBcZrVL+\nnVUlupSN2so3dM6bv1lJEsCUxjfGeu6yNRciog/7TSsaeazLM5xKmxIMUBWJXUQG\na9rQLdG9AngqHrjFsF3XjMiqf+NQDEVyO/0c8wygwpHOzyfx6Mdi++UihkRBUPYV\ny+0VR27HxmWaXpCgAbwGcn+Igbp4O42rkQ7/fAGqF2Yg123vgRDqCAYZ04leIzIH\nwXxVGH/cmOVoiUapCVsf6SAYcl98RvECuhmHF/dM1DJccWw6W6VfXcGy9LfcEjuQ\n8M8vnQyKhRMUgHxFrZ3iMuCTV8TuYBTYy0PS4aKrGkEWb7U87n6jPOKd2h8uNCIY\nf62I2OkZp37exrNxscYSosx9z1MnZNtXDGrrVS+371Wz9lcdVcPMAa4NdcMQI8eN\nwgGyoMPJj7s+T7ZkfyUg\n=ILlo\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T13:26:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow