"html_url":"https://github.com/rocketride-org/rocketride-server/commit/7506d3933d59baeab01b9a0cdd39bacfff9aacfa","sha":"7506d3933d59baeab01b9a0cdd39bacfff9aacfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rocketride-org/rocketride-server/commits/7506d3933d59baeab01b9a0cdd39bacfff9aacfa"}],"sha":"cd00bc249c97945038548d025755f570f2a87f15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rocketride-org/rocketride-server/commits/cd00bc249c97945038548d025755f570f2a87f15"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/322872359?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dk-rocketride/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dk-rocketride/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dk-rocketride/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dk-rocketride/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dk-rocketride","id":322872359,"login":"dk-rocketride","node_id":"U_kgDOEz6kJw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dk-rocketride/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dk-rocketride/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dk-rocketride/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dk-rocketride/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dk-rocketride/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dk-rocketride","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rocketride-org/rocketride-server/commits/7506d3933d59baeab01b9a0cdd39bacfff9aacfa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T19:08:10Z","email":"dmitrii.kataraev@rocketride.ai","name":"dk-rocketride"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T19:08:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(client-python): work with opentelemetry-exporter-otlp-proto-http 1.45 (#2426)\n\n* fix(client-python): work with opentelemetry-exporter-otlp-proto-http 1.45\n\n1.45 (released 2026-09-25) no longer depends on requests and moved the\nexporter''s headers and session onto an internal client. On a fresh install\nour non-redirecting requests session raised ModuleNotFoundError, and the\nsetup tests failed on every PR because they read the old private fields.\n\nPass the requests session only when requests is installed; 1.45''s default\nurllib3 transport already refuses redirects. The tests read headers and\nsession through helpers that handle both layouts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015nTVr6jfSFYm1GppxbjghP\n\n* fix(client-python): declare requests for the otel bridge instead of working around it\n\nsetup.py subclasses requests.Session, but rocketride never declared\nrequests; it came in through the exporter until 1.45. Add it to the [otel]\nextra and to tests/requirements.txt (same floor the exporter used,\n~=2.7 -> >=2.7), and drop the try-import fallback and its test so there is\none code path with our own redirect protection.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015nTVr6jfSFYm1GppxbjghP\n\n* fix(client-python): require requests>=2.32.4 (CVE-2024-47081)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015nTVr6jfSFYm1GppxbjghP\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"908760049bf777ae4b9d60b85e3410e811191712","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rocketride-org/rocketride-server/git/trees/908760049bf777ae4b9d60b85e3410e811191712"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rocketride-org/rocketride-server/git/commits/7506d3933d59baeab01b9a0cdd39bacfff9aacfa","verification":{"payload":"tree 908760049bf777ae4b9d60b85e3410e811191712\nparent a1fa4f15b5c61c51e450ffb6d24057b7edcf13d3\nauthor dk-rocketride <dmitrii.kataraev@rocketride.ai> 1790363290 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790363290 -0700\n\nfix(client-python): work with opentelemetry-exporter-otlp-proto-http 1.45 (#2426)\n\n* fix(client-python): work with opentelemetry-exporter-otlp-proto-http 1.45\n\n1.45 (released 2026-09-25) no longer depends on requests and moved the\nexporter''s headers and session onto an internal client. On a fresh install\nour non-redirecting requests session raised ModuleNotFoundError, and the\nsetup tests failed on every PR because they read the old private fields.\n\nPass the requests session only when requests is installed; 1.45''s default\nurllib3 transport already refuses redirects. The tests read headers and\nsession through helpers that handle both layouts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015nTVr6jfSFYm1GppxbjghP\n\n* fix(client-python): declare requests for the otel bridge instead of working around it\n\nsetup.py subclasses requests.Session, but rocketride never declared\nrequests; it came in through the exporter until 1.45. Add it to the [otel]\nextra and to tests/requirements.txt (same floor the exporter used,\n~=2.7 -> >=2.7), and drop the try-import fallback and its test so there is\none code path with our own redirect protection.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015nTVr6jfSFYm1GppxbjghP\n\n* fix(client-python): require requests>=2.32.4 (CVE-2024-47081)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015nTVr6jfSFYm1GppxbjghP\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtsaaCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAU0MQAAeSMwNHfloqgHRHVt1RgE2b\n7Oexlue6k12qKiCd72QO3I2nmasSRLi9kLo6LLvkiQtsX6rSlyZobrVnsUkfiUPg\nphVNrbtxFo+EgXJy84lpa6L/mIqevOyY6ErioaBQH0eH2PhA5AVyJU8yhh1qo1i2\n5j