=5.2.3 in a\nthrowaway venv), so there is no image to lose. The S3Store suite passes the\nsame against both: 76/76 on MinIO and on moto, run in the engine image.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015nTVr6jfSFYm1GppxbjghP\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"396137fb6e9c1778562ef42915568f75e7849793","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rocketride-org/rocketride-server/git/trees/396137fb6e9c1778562ef42915568f75e7849793"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rocketride-org/rocketride-server/git/commits/96164a564e8f783506452d576a594429b5664e2a","verification":{"payload":"tree 396137fb6e9c1778562ef42915568f75e7849793\nparent aebb8aa92a56e433b6a8f41de0211021b5f45a45\nauthor dk-rocketride <dmitrii.kataraev@rocketride.ai> 1790276174 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790276174 -0700\n\nci: run the S3Store tests against moto instead of MinIO (#2418)\n\nMinIO stopped public distribution: quay.io/minio/minio answers 401 for the\npinned RELEASE.2025-09-07T16-13-09Z, Docker Hub''s minio/minio is gone and\ndl.min.io answers 410 for the binary, so every Linux build failed at\n''Start MinIO for tests''. moto is a pip package (moto[server]==5.2.3 in a\nthrowaway venv), so there is no image to lose. The S3Store suite passes the\nsame against both: 76/76 on MinIO and on moto, run in the engine image.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015nTVr6jfSFYm1GppxbjghP\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtXJOCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHAUQADRGe8El+A/2bjzCt0mFX7xC\nBd+fgBZ6by4bERjq+MqfJtCEWtW1lOAsRUnWNwdu5HxlKwD8Z/qVE6Z7Su0AZH1X\naDVkN6xt8wDgscZsp4f4wvoNb6cNRub6ozPjZoQus/cZ/cUcDMPIkYvToV9uTrRg\nTKUvS8zp1vVZOsljo47RvIOopM2yJzjuRFVdUlFaX4aWZNU9nrwEZvobGEkW5kbK\nCssWfyYTNo5BRXMjhh0wfuaduLhnJX7GRWld9o7s7okiE/P5E/L7tQcHazXI1j1e\nWEp/zYQJY5QFHHRdBU8iBibtclifM0V9ikCe7dQmqKQX7jn8ud2TKQMcFDwG5YwG\nWvwXZESdWg