2ZmMTY1YjI1YWIzNjIwYTMyNTQ2Mjc2MTM3MGNlYzRkOGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rocketride-org/rocketride-server/commit/981d1c5de04ab88d8714b8ce955b1a2747b66fe4","sha":"981d1c5de04ab88d8714b8ce955b1a2747b66fe4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rocketride-org/rocketride-server/commits/981d1c5de04ab88d8714b8ce955b1a2747b66fe4"}],"sha":"d18367ff165b25ab3620a325462761370cec4d8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rocketride-org/rocketride-server/commits/d18367ff165b25ab3620a325462761370cec4d8e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13753038?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwit75/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwit75/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwit75/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwit75/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kwit75","id":13753038,"login":"kwit75","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNzUzMDM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwit75/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwit75/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwit75/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwit75/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwit75/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwit75","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rocketride-org/rocketride-server/commits/981d1c5de04ab88d8714b8ce955b1a2747b66fe4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:19:27Z","email":"dmitry.karataev@gmail.com","name":"Dmitrii Karataev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:19:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(account): apply requiredPermissions to the versioned bundle route (#2401) (#2406)\n\nThe catalog hides an app whose manifest declares requiredPermissions from\ncallers who lack them. The versioned route /apps/<id>/v<N>/... did not:\nentitled_version_dirs() checked only the publish row''s state, review\nladder and build, and never looked at requiredPermissions. The seeder\npublishes platform apps to the public audience, so on production the\nfive gated apps (brandy, admin, benchmark and models declare\n[\"sys.admin\"], appAdmin declares [\"sys.app\"]) served their bundles to\nunauthenticated callers while the catalog refused them.\n\nentitled_version_dirs now skips a binding whose snapshot declares\nrequiredPermissions the caller does not hold, using the exact rule the\ncatalog uses in _catalog_entries: ALL declared permissions, and sys.admin\npasses as the platform superuser. Anonymous holds none. The developer-rail\nbranch is unchanged.\n\nTests: anonymous and permissionless callers are refused, a holder is\nserved, ALL-of semantics, sys.admin bypass, and an ungated public app\nstill serves pre-auth.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015nTVr6jfSFYm1GppxbjghP\n\nCo-authored-by: Dmitrii Kataraev <dmitrii.kataraev@rocketride.ai>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f9fcb5ff23fd864d44aa9409c0cfa24416d7bfc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rocketride-org/rocketride-server/git/trees/f9fcb5ff23fd864d44aa9409c0cfa24416d7bfc6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rocketride-org/rocketride-server/git/commits/981d1c5de04ab88d8714b8ce955b1a2747b66fe4","verification":{"payload":"tree f9fcb5ff23fd864d44aa9409c0cfa24416d7bfc6\nparent ffa01c73a1fdf4b3944353c8da69bd348f95c637\nauthor Dmitrii Karataev <dmitry.karataev@gmail.com> 1790180367 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790180367 -0700\n\nfix(account): apply requiredPermissions to the versioned bundle route (#2401) (#2406)\n\nThe catalog hides an app whose manifest declares requiredPermissions from\ncallers who lack them. The versioned route /apps/<id>/v<N>/... did not:\nentitled_version_dirs() checked only the publish row''s state, review\nladder and build, and never looked at requiredPermissions. The seeder\npublishes platform apps to the public audience, so on production the\nfive gated apps (brandy, admin, benchmark and models declare\n[\"sys.admin\"], appAdmin declares [\"sys.app\"]) served their bundles to\nunauthenticated callers while the catalog refused them.\n\nentitled_version_dirs now skips a binding whose snapshot declares\nrequiredPermissions the caller does not hold, using the exact rule the\ncatalog uses in _catalog_entries: ALL declared permissions, and sys.admin\npasses as the platform superuser. Anonymous holds none. The developer-rail\nbranch is unchanged.\n\nTests: anonymous and permissionless callers are refused, a holder is\nserved, ALL-of semantics, sys.admin bypass, and an ungated public app\nstill serves pre-auth.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015nTVr6jfSFYm1GppxbjghP\n\nCo-authored-by: Dmitrii Kataraev <dmitrii.kataraev@rocketride.ai>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqs/wPCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGR4QAC7+xbpu5nLNtCBWMIFxstnh\npuyazIrX8Hl+Gxs/EzsnO78iL58mIjYoJN+DgQ1PyP7o4mtce2FLl2EdzA4Fw1T0\nZISYFEqy41m5a0fCXPUDKfnKwir/DcvSjbRBy9EMx/SBuQypouWscwsyCYnSCSdr\n3XN6QPB5agX1k4uOSwDHVN71u/+Hrj9O3G0dsApClLhjJ1vdX9DxlZacnwk9rNd8\nV+bkcqpH/Dw0umls0dC0iDuybgk1YGfRkThBRGYsEKbPvVw1b6dPRn3mZK1bZs91\nUsFi2lTKeKtUhoCkeB0ydUojHmi9Q+2MTkDhcttFLy2UPwpusZQl2EOuPA4jXSWG\nLRJyNTHqfafCbRDnhjSIRnNuk2bxKsoPpxKBbZbHIkKmf1nb4eq/m51J3gxs6QYQ\n/dHGT5fVUzK9nm2y94Hdf1Jf/Hu4PzTx/fSPUVyTggWWd001aW6qhFD33OPhlUG0\nByIhvPZ9jEfyr+YW2AvNchON2lCkzlggibu9hAahf2vpS4gL6sGgj8wgDRx6/TPP\n6HnYDBzL9UP0BThIAxM6knsLbOeMZ3lqcyZcwXJP4bw8tKPTqm+q1ggVv77YCIsz\n58qDwFQzbqgpDlitRf7lDLoOpRWwPSZQHMfEA3kZHp24FLlXAZfhzYBgh41B2EHk\nToJMT7lZvs8LFmwtHCJP\n=gsFP\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-23T16:19:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.co