ide-server/commits/ffa01c73a1fdf4b3944353c8da69bd348f95c637"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13753038?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwit75/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwit75/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwit75/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwit75/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kwit75","id":13753038,"login":"kwit75","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNzUzMDM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwit75/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwit75/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwit75/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwit75/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwit75/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwit75","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rocketride-org/rocketride-server/commits/9d07cef5b2bda4bf6ce50887adba6dfa83414a32/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T01:01:52Z","email":"dmitry.karataev@gmail.com","name":"Dmitrii Karataev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T01:01:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"release: bump to server 3.4.0 / clients 1.4.0 and cut the changelog (#2400)\n\nNothing has reached npm, PyPI, Open VSX or the VS Code Marketplace since\n2026-07-07. All five artefacts sit at 1.3.0 because `main` has not moved since\nthat date, while `develop` carries 758 commits of work that no release train\nhas ever picked up.\n\nThe versions on develop could not be released as they stood:\n\n  server              3.3.0  < published 3.3.1, tag server-v3.3.0 taken\n  vscode              1.2.0  < published 1.3.0, tag vscode-v1.2.0 taken\n  client-typescript   1.3.0  = published, tag taken\n  client-python       1.3.0  = published, tag taken\n  client-mcp          1.5.0  unpublished, tag free\n\nEvery one of them would have been skipped by the tag and version-exists checks,\nso a release run would have been green and shipped nothing.\n\nThis bumps the four that needed it and leaves client-mcp at 1.5.0, which is\nalready a valid unused candidate. Verified free before choosing them: the tags\nserver-v3.4.0, vscode-v1.4.0, client-typescript-v1.4.0, client-python-v1.4.0 and\nclient-mcp-v1.5.0 are all absent, and npm 1.4.0, PyPI 1.4.0, PyPI mcp 1.5.0 and\nOpen VSX 1.4.0 all return not-found.\n\nThe changelog cut rides this PR as RELEASE.md requires, so the release body is a\nscoped section rather than an ever-growing [Unreleased] blob.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015nTVr6jfSFYm1GppxbjghP\n\nCo-authored-by: Dmitrii Kataraev <dmitrii.kataraev@rocketride.ai>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b3044841445968b4bcbd1b684bbcec94c004ffe4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rocketride-org/rocketride-server/git/trees/b3044841445968b4bcbd1b684bbcec94c004ffe4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rocketride-org/rocketride-server/git/commits/9d07cef5b2bda4bf6ce50887adba6dfa83414a32","verification":{"payload":"tree b3044841445968b4bcbd1b684bbcec94c004ffe4\nparent 9fd85b50854ec9b16b3d453649cf395be5208f61\nauthor Dmitrii Karataev <dmitry.karataev@gmail.com> 1790125312 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790125312 -0700\n\nrelease: bump to server 3.4.0 / clients 1.4.0 and cut the changelog (#2400)\n\nNothing has reached npm, PyPI, Open VSX or the VS Code Marketplace since\n2026-07-07. All five artefacts sit at 1.3.0 because `main` has not moved since\nthat date, while `develop` carries 758 commits of work that no release train\nhas ever picked up.\n\nThe versions on develop could not be released as they stood:\n\n  server              3.3.0  < published 3.3.1, tag server-v3.3.0 taken\n  vscode              1.2.0  < published 1.3.0, tag vscode-v1.2.0 taken\n  client-typescript   1.3.0  = published, tag taken\n  client-python       1.3.0  = published, tag taken\n  client-mcp          1.5.0  unpublished, tag free\n\nEvery one of them would have been skipped by the tag and version-exists checks,\nso a release run would have been green and shipped nothing.\n\nThis bumps the four that needed it and leaves client-mcp at 1.5.0, which is\nalready a valid unused candidate. Verified free before choosing them: the tags\nserver-v3.4.0, vscode-v1.4.0, client-typescript-v1.4.0, client-python-v1.4.0 and\nclient-mcp-v1.5.0 are all absent, and npm 1.4.0, PyPI 1.4.0, PyPI mcp 1.5.0 and\nOpen VSX 1.4.0 all return not-found.\n\nThe changelog cut rides this PR as RELEASE.md requires, so the release body is a\nscoped section rather than an ever-growing [Unreleased] blob.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015nTVr6jfSFYm1GppxbjghP\n\nCo-authored-by: Dmitrii Kataraev <dmitrii.kataraev@rocketride.ai>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsyUACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAE6kQAA0TZF5CW2V4YJmCDBR/1nXQ\nudYahx4EnQ5/Aw25wi1LdfOKzOiZLUCK2uczBW42128VSce4yM9hS0ViCuo3eo1O\nfQ49nozqQE5qxlu9Q6VxX2CDVL7WI0kJrAmKUoqDfa2D14FXINBKOWYng6zAbuv4\nR+POAsigQ8YXAkP9pAaMPheS1J9jFvDIqdHgcMnMrWkZGebPSO0Nx83gNquVpvcY\nG+H4nql+espznwep2WFqrnMANMVI+zrrsY0UjE5mWIFuJiT5kvr6kq//UDuw8YMr\nUHn8sD2FTYjtMA50uyRHqNScoL4x9uhz7L4Igul8apEJBthUvIIw1wU0iTLFHGoz\njiXF1WA4Ikkt5skOu8RV7vng6w2pBQ5+HCWQgGXolzpYuTQ225vrd2bJWlztEvN0\nV+WkYxu3FjFjhoicB3H1Jcz/EvR0r5ZyBO2jWLgqLxgoBT73dUurtJ3ODSI7bk58\nDxMAwr9WL49bn4SHBGw3jUUzLenCBwLEGxk6DdK4wFt6bpWM6ZKtVPhIgohEUCoS\nvMsIj1CmMwwak6Tu9fPi5SZCwDpTLqwK22Ihrbpx/0cbT9IrJLhdnIV1+X6AJD1p\ny7f8+YNkm/I1KUcx6KpNtUVlV2fU6YtdkytW31ij2p2F2bH6lqAhP8op++7+mSFq\nFAfEdAd1ilz9+edgEPel\n=OVp7\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-23T01:01:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuserconten