github.com/users/asclearuc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/asclearuc","id":29624014,"login":"asclearuc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NjI0MDE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asclearuc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asclearuc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asclearuc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asclearuc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asclearuc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/asclearuc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rocketride-org/rocketride-server/commits/97bb71c55c656830cb9fbd2fc7f1ccda2014118a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T12:49:04Z","email":"asclearuc@gmail.com","name":"Alexandru Sclearuc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T12:49:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(nodes): stop four nodes passing raw input downstream (#2304)\n\nAfter a Python lane handler returns normally, the engine also forwards the handler''s input on the same lane. Only `preventDefault()` stops that. Four nodes returned normally, so downstream received the raw input next to the node''s own output.\n\n- `context_optimizer`: both exits of `writeQuestions` now end in `return self.preventDefault()`. Downstream no longer gets the untrimmed original next to the trimmed question.\n- `summarization`: `writeText` and `writeTable` collect the text, then suppress the forward. Only the summary from `closing()` goes on.\n- `tool_guild`: `writeText`, `writeQuestions` and `writeDocuments` collect, then suppress. The docstring claiming \"overriding suppresses raw passthrough\" is corrected.\n- `tool_n8n`: the same for `writeText`, `writeQuestions`, `writeDocuments`, and every `writeImage` / `writeAudio` / `writeVideo` chunk.\n- Missing docstrings added in the four node files.\n\nTests:\n\n- `test_lane_forward_once_nodes.py`: delivery-count cases for every changed handler.\n- New `summarization/test_summarization.py`: the node had no unit tests.\n- `context_optimizer/test_all.py` and `test_tool_n8n.py`: direct handler calls now require the `PreventDefault` exception.","tree":{"sha":"58980f7d71a2607f38e37d2403fa1910d14ce546","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rocketride-org/rocketride-server/git/trees/58980f7d71a2607f38e37d2403fa1910d14ce546"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rocketride-org/rocketride-server/git/commits/97bb71c55c656830cb9fbd2fc7f1ccda2014118a","verification":{"payload":"tree 58980f7d71a2607f38e37d2403fa1910d14ce546\nparent 3f6e3472dbe0e2d91301cb77d955773ec75ab24f\nauthor Alexandru Sclearuc <asclearuc@gmail.com> 1789649344 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789649344 +0000\n\nfix(nodes): stop four nodes passing raw input downstream (#2304)\n\nAfter a Python lane handler returns normally, the engine also forwards the handler''s input on the same lane. Only `preventDefault()` stops that. Four nodes returned normally, so downstream received the raw input next to the node''s own output.\n\n- `context_optimizer`: both exits of `writeQuestions` now end in `return self.preventDefault()`. Downstream no longer gets the untrimmed original next to the trimmed question.\n- `summarization`: `writeText` and `writeTable` collect the text, then suppress the forward. Only the summary from `closing()` goes on.\n- `tool_guild`: `writeText`, `writeQuestions` and `writeDocuments` collect, then suppress. The docstring claiming \"overriding suppresses raw passthrough\" is corrected.\n- `tool_n8n`: the same for `writeText`, `writeQuestions`, `writeDocuments`, and every `writeImage` / `writeAudio` / `writeVideo` chunk.\n- Missing docstrings added in the four node files.\n\nTests:\n\n- `test_lane_forward_once_nodes.py`: delivery-count cases for every changed handler.\n- New `summarization/test_summarization.py`: the node had no unit tests.\n- `context_optimizer/test_all.py` and `test_tool_n8n.py`: direct handler calls now require the `PreventDefault` exception.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqq+HACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjTkQAEvzjDILxjPxErtUVma6ArnM\nIkzSpGWWpUYAA/3igUfKbkxlx+ShMC6yCnKRY0TSErhelSWxhU6mTOjtKEhJIYGw\nHw1lJl06iT/gJY2wK3/QTAk5shVMbfs1fWy6sHriACcezsd7D+rtOP4YNOUWk0NU\nJebh0xLQ3sIv+aguBJDcDe8rN50JBqmuT5ilzQX/udByC6gg2NXVFuvwC88G9plx\nysyqVYYAD8IV56eZVl4Lg3yHcnLvtxAeHQPsjgqQGxQeQObPspzuJ0YCiTWyPOKD\nkUju0kT9zTyYiNPfQo5bAd24pEjBRB1BIJI/tnHQ/QQW1AJ96l4F6XB1ksWVHels\n4MkbDWQYEFNTMai63alWeM6NH1FjFMif1vBeY2y6F4i+ecKaLFz0L/fQ9qX1uSqY\n7aaj9JSh0ChZfFr9Sq6JtqrVxk2FJqU08EeWqotUPBW+YeKv3SUcDmbF9r+Osp9z\npaiko2VMulQ3JpShWrgNN7YbS4eGCcu/rO++h340aukO+tlD/Sg/4Qium6gE0s5g\ndiP/MGqOyxe1ADDwPbc9gPPZ5Scvuh6Ib53orVsZKCOvRjvzCyo07wa9Vf9ztJWt\n/JUXGnuIGB5POsslTaVVMUGQiIZVT7gOXOv6wsGNelaT98iASzQ09M9SuGAR++gS\nY7KlgSx90k3dJLxKzq75\n=bI95\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-17T12:49:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/