e":"2026-02-11T23:12:32Z","email":"gvsrusa@gmail.com","name":"Venkata Subbarao Gorantla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-11T23:12:32Z","email":"gvsrusa@gmail.com","name":"Venkata Subbarao Gorantla"},"message":"refactor: Update GraphQL schema and improve data handling across billing and customer services\n\n- Modified GraphQL queries and mutations to enhance data structure, including renaming fields for clarity (e.g., `paidDate` to `paidAt`, `smsLimit` to `smsCount`).\n- Adjusted data fetching logic to ensure correct usage statistics are retrieved from the customer object.\n- Improved the handling of daily usage data and invoice line items by introducing new fields and removing deprecated ones.\n- Enhanced error handling and response messages in payment processing.\n- Updated the NOC dashboard to fetch device and alert data without limits for better monitoring.\n\nThese changes streamline data management and improve the overall user experience in the TelecomNexus platform.","tree":{"sha":"6e133cc8559167f5afeee585e0bf0a9ea58b3c36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gvsrusa/TelecomNexus/git/trees/6e133cc8559167f5afeee585e0bf0a9ea58b3c36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gvsrusa/TelecomNexus/git/commits/40d3663881bb473a444360e141ce25c6bf5ea099","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29243392?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gvsrusa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gvsrusa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gvsrusa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gvsrusa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gvsrusa","id":29243392,"login":"gvsrusa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MjQzMzky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gvsrusa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gvsrusa/receiv