"author":{"date":"2026-02-11T22:36:07Z","email":"gvsrusa@gmail.com","name":"Venkata Subbarao Gorantla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-11T22:36:07Z","email":"gvsrusa@gmail.com","name":"Venkata Subbarao Gorantla"},"message":"feat: Enhance billing and customer services with GraphQL and MongoDB integration\n\n- Implemented Apollo Server for billing and customer services with GraphQL schema and resolvers.\n- Added MongoDB models for invoices and payments, including CRUD operations.\n- Integrated Cassandra for call detail records and usage statistics.\n- Established REST endpoints for importing/exporting customer data in XML format.\n- Introduced GraphQL subscriptions for real-time updates on ticket status.\n- Enhanced validation with Zod for input schemas in payment and customer updates.\n- Updated package dependencies for Apollo, Express, and MongoDB.\n\nThis commit significantly improves the functionality and scalability of the TelecomNexus platform.","tree":{"sha":"0f0585d942cf70aa216c302791dbf69063ea72ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gvsrusa/TelecomNexus/git/trees/0f0585d942cf70aa216c302791dbf69063ea72ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gvsrusa/TelecomNexus/git/commits/9f924854a51ce15b96b96020f8da1268a64b57c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29243392?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gvsrusa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gvsrusa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gvsrusa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gvsrusa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gvsrusa","id":29243392,"login":"gvsrusa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MjQzMzky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gvsrusa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gvsrusa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gvsrusa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gvsrusa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gvsrusa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gvsrusa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gvsrusa/TelecomNexus/commit/9f924854a51ce15b96b96020f8da1268a64b57c9","node_id":"C_kwDOROJOFNoAKDlmOTI0ODU0YTUxY2UxNWI5NmI5NjAyMGY4ZGExMjY4YTY0YjU3Yzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gvsrusa/TelecomNexus/commit/e168bd1c9bcf643e5ec66a534acfe7353d0d0516","sha":"e168bd1c9bcf643e5ec66a534acfe7353d0d0516","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gvsrusa/TelecomNexus/commits/e168bd1c9bcf643e5ec66a534acfe7353d0d0516"}],"sha":"9f924854a51ce15b96b96020f8da1268a64b57c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gvsrusa/TelecomNexus/commits/9f924854a51ce15b96b96020f8da1268a64b57c9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29243392?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gvsrusa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gvsrusa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gvsrusa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gvsrusa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gvsrusa","id":29243392,"login":"gvsrusa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MjQzMzky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gvsrusa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gvsrusa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gvsrusa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gvsrusa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gvsrusa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gvsrusa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gvsrusa/TelecomNexus/commits/e168bd1c9bcf643e5ec66a534acfe7353d0d0516/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-11T21:30:00Z","email":"gvsrusa@gmail.com","name":"Venkata Subbarao Gorantla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-11T21:30:00Z","email":"gvsrusa@gmail.com","name":"Venkata Subbarao Gorantla"},"message":"feat: Add TelecomNexus full-stack implementation (Phases 1-8)\n\nComplete monorepo implementation of the TelecomNexus telecom management\nplatform including:\n\n- Monorepo scaffold with npm workspaces and Turborepo\n- Shared packages: types (branded), GraphQL schema (Federation v2),\n  UI components (React-Bootstrap), XML utilities\n- Backend microservices: customer-service, network-service, billing-service\n  with Apollo Server, Express, Mongoose, and Cassandra drivers\n- Apollo Gateway with federation composition\n- Shell application (Next.js 16) with customer portal, NOC dashboard,\n  and billing console micro-frontends\n- Standalone MFE apps: customer-portal, noc-dashboard, billing-console\n- Docker Compose for MongoDB and Cassandra\n- ESLint 9 flat config, Prettier, Husky pre-commit hooks\n- Phase 1-8 implementation documentation\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"8c21645fc2d32f8275f01fd23ed402ff9ebc5beb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gvsrusa/TelecomNexus/git/trees/8c21645fc2d32f8275f01fd23ed402ff9ebc5beb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gvsrusa/TelecomNexus/git/commits/e168bd1c9bcf643e5ec66a534acfe7353d0d0516","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29243392?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gvsrusa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gvsrusa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gvsrusa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gvsrusa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gvsrusa","id":29243392,"login":"gvsrusa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MjQzMzky","organizations_url"