container (<aside id=\"sidebar\" class=\"sidebar\"></aside>).\n\nThis container is required for app.js to inject dynamic navigation\ninto section pages. Without it, the sidebar navigation doesn''t appear.\n\nAffected paths:\n- frontend-mastery: 42 files (21 EN, 21 ES)\n- fullstack: 32 files (16 EN, 16 ES)\n- softwarecycle: 32 files (15 EN, 15 ES + docker-containers.html EN/ES)\n\nThe sidebar injection mechanism now works correctly across all pages,\nensuring consistent navigation experience throughout the entire\nlearning platform.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"05d6e68c08930c3e2653b74d31a8df0941dded24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RogeMateos/JuniorToSenior/git/trees/05d6e68c08930c3e2653b74d31a8df0941dded24"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RogeMateos/JuniorToSenior/git/commits/5b92245bb90de3a18abed0f9f403d2f2f0618a26","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2786311?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RogeMateos","id":2786311,"login":"RogeMateos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3ODYzMTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RogeMate