?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RogeMateos","id":2786311,"login":"RogeMateos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3ODYzMTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RogeMateos/JuniorToSenior/commits/6dec6a2fb0a86b69668818c66bee3133de3b3657/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-20T14:21:14Z","email":"rogemateos@hotmail.com","name":"Roge"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-20T14:21:14Z","email":"rogemateos@hotmail.com","name":"Roge"},"message":"Create Software Architecture section folder structure\n\n- Add softwarearchitecture/ folder at root level (parallel to softwarecycle/)\n- Create en/ and es/ subdirectories for bilingual content\n- Add index.html with language selector (matching softwarecycle pattern)\n- Ready for architecture tutorials: SOLID, Design Patterns, System Design, etc.\n\nThis section will cover professional software architecture topics including:\n- SOLID principles\n- Design patterns\n- System design\n- Architecture patterns\n- Microservices\n- Domain-driven design\n- And more...\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9528deb96ae6bf2f37b694896cffb032a5af9f6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RogeMateos/JuniorToSenior/git/trees/95