caling, health checks)\n- Modern orchestrators (AWS ECS, Kubernetes, Azure Container Apps)\n- What orchestrators really do (instance management, scaling, health)\n- Deployment strategies (Rolling, Blue/Green, Canary)\n- Container security (no root, image scanning, secrets management)\n- Key principle: Immutable images (same artifact in all environments)\n- Multi-stage builds and observability\n- Complete real-world flow (push → deploy → monitor → rollback)\n- Why companies use this model\n- What modern fullstack developers should know\n\nFiles created:\n- softwarecycle/en/docker-cicd.html\n- softwarecycle/es/docker-cicd.html\n\nNavigation:\n- Added bilingual link to Section 7 (Software Lifecycle)\n- Updated app.js with proper language-aware routing\n\nResources:\n- Added Dragos ChatGPT CI/CD with Docker guide link\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4aae3e8458b789a8a76ea91e7390fd57c5dfa90c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RogeMateos/JuniorToSenior/git/trees/4aae3e8458b789a8a76ea91e7390fd57c5dfa90c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RogeMateos/JuniorToSenior/git/commits/351eca2f03c9bb5feb2faabe27b25836c62d4669","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2786311?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RogeMateos","id":2786311,"login":"RogeMateos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3ODYzMTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RogeMateos/JuniorToSenior/commit/351eca2f03c9bb5feb2faabe27b25836c62d4669","node_id":"C_kwDORO5BhtoAKDM1MWVjYTJmMDNjOWJiNWZlYjJmYWFiZTI3YjI1ODM2YzYyZDQ2Njk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RogeMateos/JuniorToSenior/commit/b5c5053dd9b1b3be2d4b6e211df5c682a0a9b7b9","sha":"b5c5053dd9b1b3be2d4b6e211df5c682a0a9b7b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RogeMateos/JuniorToSenior/commits/b5c5053dd9b1b3be2d4b6e211df5c682a0a9b7b9"}],"sha":"351eca2f03c9bb5feb2faabe27b25836c62d4669","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RogeMateos/JuniorToSenior/commits/351eca2f03c9bb5feb2faabe27b25836c62d4669"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2786311?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RogeMateos","id":2786311,"login":"RogeMateos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3ODYzMTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RogeMateos/JuniorToSenior/commits/b5c5053dd9b1b3be2d4b6e211df5c682a0a9b7b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-20T13:22:19Z","email":"rogemateos@hotmail.com","name":"Roge"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-20T13:22:19Z","email":"rogemateos@hotmail.com","name":"Roge"},"message":"Add comprehensive Docker containers tutorial (2.0)\n\n- Create new tutorial: \"🐳 2.0 Introduction to Containers with Docker\"\n- Covers fundamental Docker concepts from senior developer perspective\n- 20 detailed sections covering containers, images, Dockerfiles, CI/CD\n\nContent includes:\n- Why containers exist (solving \"works on my machine\" problem)\n- Container vs VM architecture (namespaces, cgroups, kernel sharing)\n- Docker fundamentals: Engine, Dockerfile, Image, Container, Registry\n- Hands-on examples: WordPress quick start, Node.js Dockerfile\n- Multi-stage builds for production (separating build and runtime)\n- Volumes and persistence management\n- Environment variables vs secrets\n- Layer caching and optimization\n- CI/CD pipeline integration\n- Debugging strategies and common pitfalls\n- Senior-level best practices (no root, small images, healthchecks, SHAs)\n- Practical exercises and mental models\n\nFiles created:\n- softwarecycle/en/docker-containers.html\n- softwarecycle/es/docker-containers.html\n\nNavigation:\n- Added bilingual link to Section 7 (Software Lifecycle)\n- Updated app.js with proper language-aware routing\n\nResources:\n- Added Dragos ChatGPT Docker guide link\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6f78daecd143cdfb60e8917db0f890d5ae324f27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RogeMateos/JuniorToSenior/git/trees/6f78daecd143cdfb60e8917db0f890d5ae324f27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RogeMateos/JuniorToSenior/git/commits/b5c5053dd9b1b3be2d4b6e211df5c682a0a9b7b9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2786311?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/eve