}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RogeMateos","id":2786311,"login":"RogeMateos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3ODYzMTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogeMateos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RogeMateos/JuniorToSenior/commits/44c0665d3e307039852739fb02000c611329b49b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-17T20:53:51Z","email":"rogemateos@hotmail.com","name":"Roge"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-17T20:53:51Z","email":"rogemateos@hotmail.com","name":"Roge"},"message":"Add section 1.4: Database Design (bilingual ES/EN)\n\n- SQL vs NoSQL comparison with use cases\n- Normalization: BAD schema vs GOOD schema examples\n- Relationships: 1:N, N:N, 1:1 with diagrams\n- Primary Keys, Foreign Keys, Unique Keys\n- Indexes for query performance (B-tree, table scans)\n- Constraints (NOT NULL, UNIQUE, CHECK, FK with CASCADE)\n- ACID transactions (Atomicity, Consistency, Isolation, Durability)\n- Schema versioning with Migrations\n- ORM introduction (Prisma, TypeORM, Sequelize)\n- Query performance: N+1 problem and EXPLAIN ANALYZE\n- Real-world blog schema (users, posts, comments, tags)\n- Senior checklist with database best practices\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"42e5340d7613ab6c155318acb4135e8e7422e61c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RogeMateos/JuniorToSenior/git/trees/42e5340d7613ab6c155318acb4135e8e7422e61c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RogeMateos/JuniorToSenior/git/commits/44c0665d3e