s/argocd-ingress.yaml (nginx ingress for argocd.vision-ops.xyz)\n- Add k8s/argocd-repos.yaml (Bitnami OCI registry for ArgoCD)\n- Add k8s/argocd-apps/vision-infra.yaml (multi-source: redis, minio,\nmonitoring)\n- redis: OCI from registry-1.docker.io/bitnamicharts, releaseName=redis\n  - minio: charts.min.io, releaseName=minio\n  - monitoring: prometheus-community, releaseName=prometheus\n- Add k8s/argocd-apps/vision-apps.yaml (vision-api, vision-frontend from\nGit)\n\n- Update helmfile.yaml.gotmpl with postsync hooks:\n  - ingress-nginx: apply letsencrypt-issuer.yaml\n  - argocd: wait for server, apply ingress + repos + apps\n- Update README.md with ArgoCD credentials and access info","tree":{"sha":"49bcdd8d2ec681a03300e30d59934a054b26dd5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astitvaveergarg/Vision-Ops/git/trees/49bcdd8d2ec681a03300e30d59934a054b26dd5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astitvaveergarg/Vision-Ops/git/commits/773f6eae86e62949dfa639455a254395110f7d90","verification":{"payload":"tree 49bcdd8d2ec681a03300e30d59934a054b26dd5f\nparent 75090e60ac484e80e0daa160bb14e7c5a9638f9f\nparent 255b3d1b6e6f4b8b02a373a160ef19a7c9ae2964\nauthor Astitva Veer Garg <91984568+astitvaveergarg@users.noreply.github.com> 1772921660 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772921660 +0530\n\nfeat: ArgoCD GitOps setup with multi-source Helm apps (#8)\n\n- Add charts/infrastructure/argocd/ Helm values (base + dev)\n  - Admin password set via argocdServerAdminPassword (ArgoAdmin2026!)\n  - Viewer readonly account with RBAC policy\n  - server.secretkey configured\n  - Subdomain: argocd.vision-ops.xyz\n\n- Add k8s/argocd-ingress.yaml (nginx ingress for argocd.vision-ops.xyz)\n- Add k8s/argocd-repos.yaml (Bitnami OCI registry for ArgoCD)\n- Add k8s/argocd-apps/vision-infra.yaml (multi-source: redis, minio,\nmonitoring)\n- redis: OCI from registry-1.docker.io/bitnamicharts, releaseName=redis\n  - minio: charts.min.io, releaseName=minio\n  - monitoring: prometheus-community, re