s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astitvaveergarg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astitvaveergarg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astitvaveergarg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astitvaveergarg","id":91984568,"login":"astitvaveergarg","node_id":"U_kgDOBXuSuA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astitvaveergarg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astitvaveergarg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astitvaveergarg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astitvaveergarg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astitvaveergarg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astitvaveergarg","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astitvaveergarg/Vision-Ops/commits/61661f9d01b7f8d536578ff8018d78229810f650/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-07T16:33:20Z","email":"91984568+astitvaveergarg@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Astitva Veer Garg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-07T16:33:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: GKE deployment - separate frontend chart, secrets hardening, GC… (#5)\n\n## New: charts/frontend/ - Standalone Frontend Helm Chart\n- Dedicated Helm chart for vision-frontend (nginx) fully decoupled from\ncharts/api\n- Deployment, Service, Ingress, ConfigMap (nginx.conf), _helpers.tpl\n- nginx proxies /api/* -> vision-api.vision-app.svc.cluster.local:8000\n(full DNS)\n- client_max_body_size and proxy timeouts configurable via values\n- values.yaml + values-dev.yaml + values-local.yaml + values-prod.yaml\n- vision-api has NO public ingress (ClusterIP only); only\nvision-frontend is exposed\n\n## New: terraform/gcp/ - GCP GKE Infrastructure\n- GKE cluster (vision-dev-gke, us-central1-a, e2-standard-4 nodes)\n- Node pools: general + ml (CPU-optimised for inference)\n- VPC, subnets, Cloud NAT, Cloud Armor WAF\n- Budget enforcer Cloud Function (automatic cost guardrail)\n- environments/dev.tfvars + environments/prod.tfvars\n\n## New: k8s/secrets-*.yaml.example - Secret Reference Templates\n- secrets-dev/local/prod.yaml.example with all required secret shapes\n- Secrets duplicated in vision-infra AND vision-app namespaces\n(secretKeyRef scope)\n- Names: vision-redis-credentials, vision-minio-credentials,\nvision-grafana-credentials\n- Actual k8s/secrets-*.yaml files gitignored\n\n## Modified: charts/api/ - Backend Only\n- frontend-deployment/service/configmap templates stubbed out (moved to\ncharts/frontend)\n- values.yaml: fixed base env secret names (vision-minio-credentials,\nvision-redis-credentials), REDIS_PASSWORD and MINIO_ENDPOINT added\n- values-dev.yaml: autoscaling disabled (RWO PVC constraint),\nstorageClass standard (GKE HDD quota), ingress disabled, AWS annotations\nremoved, correct secret names\n- values-local.yaml: all credentials from secretKeyRef (removed\nhardcoded minioadmin), added podDisruptionBudget + networkPolicy keys\n- values-prod.yaml: storageClass premium-rwo, AWS annotations removed,\ningress disabled, frontend block removed\n\n## Modified: charts/infrastructure/\n- redis/values-dev.yaml: existingSecret vision-redis-credentials,\nstorageClass standard\n- redis/values-prod.yaml: existingSecret vision-redis-credentials,\nstorageClass premium-rwo\n- minio/values-dev.yaml: existingSecret vision-minio-credentials,\nstorageClass standard, ingress disabled\n- minio/values-prod.yaml: existingSecret vision-minio-credentials,\nstorageClass premium-rwo\n\n## Modified: charts/monitoring/\n- prometheus/values-dev.yaml: Grafana admin from\nvision-grafana-credentials secret, storageClass standard, ingress\ndisabled\n- prometheus/values-prod.yaml: Grafana admin from\nvision-grafana-credentials secret, storageClass premium-rwo\n\n## Modified: environments/\n- dev.yaml: added frontend.enabled=true + ingress.enabled=true\n- local.yaml: added frontend.enabled=true + ingress.enabled=false\n- prod.yaml: added frontend.enabled=true + ingress.enabled=true\n\n## Modified: helmfile.yaml.gotmpl\n- Added vision-frontend release (./charts/frontend, needs:\nvision-app/vision-api)\n- Updated cloud provider comment: AWS EKS -> GKE\n- ingress-nginx controller release at version 4.10.1\n\n## Modified: frontend/index.html\n- Footer links (docs/metrics/health) changed from\nhttp://localhost:8000/* to /api/*\n- Now routes through nginx proxy, works correctly in all environments","tree":{"sha":"b2d92e407bda19c737b928d186aeccf58fb1461d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astitvaveergarg/Vision-Ops/git/trees/b2d92e407bda19c737b928d186aeccf58fb1461d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astitvaveergarg/Vision-Ops/git/commits/61661f9d01b7f8d536578ff8018d78229810f650","verification":{"payload":"tree b2d92e407bda19c737b928d186aeccf58fb1461d\nparent 3a678f0db93b364c1176cb7aafaeb59e9eba572b\nparent 5a27ba3b51ec70a954e2e6fc739cd1c518d4d345\nauthor Astitva Veer Garg <91984568+astitvaveergarg@users.noreply.github.com> 1772901200 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772901200 +0530\n\nfeat: GKE deployment - separate frontend chart, secrets hardening, GC… (#5)\n\n## New: charts/frontend/ - Standalone Frontend Helm Chart\n- Dedicated Helm chart for vision-frontend (nginx) fully decoupled from\ncharts/api\n- Deployment, Service, Ingress, ConfigMap (nginx.conf), _helpers.tpl\n- nginx proxies /api/* -> vision-api.vision-app.svc.cluster.local:8000\n(full DNS)\n- client_max_body_size and proxy timeouts configurable via values\n- values.yaml + values-dev.yaml + values-local.yaml + values-prod.yaml\n- vision-api has NO public ingress (ClusterIP only); only\nvision-frontend is exposed\n\n## New: terraform/gcp/ - GCP GKE Infrastructure\n- GKE cluster (vision-dev-gke, us-central1-a, e2-standard-4 nodes)\n- Node pools: general + ml (CPU-optimised for inference)\n- VPC, subnets, Cloud NAT, Cloud Armor WAF\n- Budget enforcer Cloud Function (automatic cost guardrail)\n- environments/dev.tfvars + environments/prod.tfvars\n\n## New: k8s/secrets-*.yaml.example - Secret Reference Templates\n- secrets-dev/local/prod.yaml.example with all required secret shapes\n- Secrets duplicated in vision-infra AND vision-app namespaces\n(secretKeyRef scope)\n- Names: vision-redis-credentials, vision-minio-credentials,\nvision-grafana-credentials\n- Actual k8s/secrets-*.yaml files gitignored\n\n## Modified: charts/api/ - Backend Only\n- frontend-deployment/service/configmap templates stubbed out (moved to\ncharts/frontend)\n- values.yaml: fixed base env secret names (vision-minio-credentials,\nvision-redis-credentials), REDIS_PASSWORD and MINIO_ENDPOINT added\n- values-dev.yaml: autoscaling disabled (RWO PVC constraint),\nstorageClass standard (GKE HDD quota), ingress disabled, AWS annotations\nremoved, correct secret names\n- values-local.yaml: all credentials from secretKeyRef (removed\nhardcoded minioadmin), added podDisruptionBudget + networkPolicy keys\n- values-prod.yaml: storageClass premium-rwo, AWS annotations removed,\ningress disabled, frontend block removed\n\n## Modified: charts/infrastructure/\n- redis/values-dev.yaml: existingSecret vision-redis-credentials,\nstorageClass standard\n- redis/values-prod.yaml: existingSecret vision-redis-credentials,\nstorageClass premium-rwo\n- minio/values-dev.yaml: existingSecret vision-minio-credentials,\nstorageClass standard, ingress disabled\n- minio/values-prod.yaml: existingSecret vision-minio-credentials,\nstorageClass premium-rwo\n\n## Modified: charts/monitoring/\n- prometheus/values-dev.yaml: Grafana admin from\nvision-grafana-credentials secret, storageClass standard, ingress\ndisabled\n- prometheus/values-prod.yaml: Grafana admin from\nvision-grafana-credentials secret, storageClass premium-rwo\n\n## Modified: environments/\n- dev.yaml: added frontend.enabled=true + ingress.enabled=true\n- local.yaml: added frontend.enabled=true + ingress.enabled=false\n- prod.yaml: added frontend.enabled=true + ingress.enabled=true\n\n## Modified: helmfile.yaml.gotmpl\n- Added vision-frontend release (./charts/frontend, needs:\nvision-app/vision-api)\n- Updated cloud provider comment: AWS EKS -> GKE\n- ingress-nginx controller release at version 4.10.1\n\n## Modified: frontend/index.html\n- Footer links (docs/metrics/health) changed from\nhttp://localhost:8000/* to /api/*\n- Now routes through nginx proxy, works correctly in all environments","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJprFNQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/18QAE2KOVper/rufTjKGOyzx3OO\nhuEnTYN5c4densx/J+l9Bms9LRN1d83rify0AwoyIGhib4xdRmS9m2mLssMwyQKI\ndK37DowCi4DNYBbid/6mq3QzQAHsAi73AB4GV9il/8F0OM3qGN9b7/0OGSrfCcbh\n08okLlndN1vWt2qf4DKNTheApxnAAsqzfPG6blURE7swjdPJSXK73T11tYZoE9bw\nD1NJxpYPs4IESfwgSjo0uOCx8J5/PT/M4jFnqEMv5S6R757zF0QtdeZ8rX3+MJ4F\n6UdwIDhOqsGHC9uGj9vT0Ad9gGq/Ed//s8aJmP1eFLZG2FwBTe4kBAohEhVcI1Op\nOV64kTkjjvyqfnY3HoMQGG0zZKLeZ1ORZJBTnORIwE640xQ8sNt0kFB+avnH0dZz\nnwYSzGB6KMDNe5ZX1wMnGZLNdityqQWZA08YTMMjALBsD2HVWcNcSUQPQFoFrYSS\nHyqAtqnmJC7oraGDjq53byHxQU9IfOGaysH7LZw89DhEFqFH5zogHHjVYXrOk80u\nhF8kJFZQYIC765yj7C++naJNxr3YzFtPWC5ZbLY84xPNTRBFAycqTGqEg3LWSsK6\nE/1o5dGsNFP1BNQ2YgMZWM1Q9NUdSNum1DllNAi/t8uq0JwCsdPqS4Q6EWprwH0M\nbg5YMyNOf7qiQpKYPkzk\n=7XQz\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-07T16:33:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url