titvaveergarg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astitvaveergarg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astitvaveergarg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astitvaveergarg","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astitvaveergarg/Vision-Ops/commits/5a27ba3b51ec70a954e2e6fc739cd1c518d4d345/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-07T16:30:14Z","email":"av4764@srmist.edu.in","name":"astitvaveergarg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-07T16:30:14Z","email":"av4764@srmist.edu.in","name":"astitvaveergarg"},"message":"feat: GKE deployment - separate frontend chart, secrets hardening, GCP Terraform\n\n## New: charts/frontend/ - Standalone Frontend Helm Chart\n- Dedicated Helm chart for vision-frontend (nginx) fully decoupled from charts/api\n- Deployment, Service, Ingress, ConfigMap (nginx.conf), _helpers.tpl\n- nginx proxies /api/* -> vision-api.vision-app.svc.cluster.local:8000 (full DNS)\n- client_max_body_size and proxy timeouts configurable via values\n- values.yaml + values-dev.yaml + values-local.yaml + values-prod.yaml\n- vision-api has NO public ingress (ClusterIP only); only vision-frontend is exposed\n\n## New: terraform/gcp/ - GCP GKE Infrastructure\n- GKE cluster (vision-dev-gke, us-central1-a, e2-standard-4 nodes)\n- Node pools: general + ml (CPU-optimised for inference)\n- VPC, subnets, Cloud NAT, Cloud Armor WAF\n- Budget enforcer Cloud Function (automatic cost guardrail)\n- environments/dev.tfvars + environments/prod.tfvars\n\n## New: k8s/secrets-*.yaml.example - Secret Reference Templates\n- secrets-dev/local/prod.yaml.example with all required secret shapes\n- Secrets duplicated in vision-infra AND vision-app namespaces (secretKeyRef scope)\n- Names: vision-redis-credentials, vision-minio-credentials, vision-grafana-credentials\n- Actual k8s/secrets-*.yaml files gitignored\n\n## Modified: charts/api/ - Backend Only\n- frontend-deployment/service/configmap templates stubbed out (moved to charts/frontend)\n- values.yaml: fixed base env secret names (vision-minio-credentials, vision-redis-credentials), REDIS_PASSWORD and MINIO_ENDPOINT added\n- values-dev.yaml: autoscaling disabled (RWO PVC constraint), storageClass standard (GKE HDD quota), ingress disabled, AWS annotations removed, correct secret names\n- values-local.yaml: all credentials from secretKeyRef (removed hardcoded minioadmin), added podDisruptionBudget + networkPolicy keys\n- values-prod.yaml: storageClass premium-rwo, AWS annotations removed, ingress disabled, frontend block removed\n\n## Modified: charts/infrastructure/\n- redis/values-dev.yaml: existingSecret vision-redis-credentials, storageClass standard\n- redis/values-prod.yaml: existingSecret vision-redis-credentials, storageClass premium-rwo\n- minio/values-dev.yaml: existingSecret vision-minio-credentials, storageClass standard, ingress disabled\n- minio/values-prod.yaml: existingSecret vision-minio-credentials, storageClass premium-rwo\n\n## Modified: charts/monitoring/\n- prometheus/values-dev.yaml: Grafana admin from vision-grafana-credentials secret, storageClass standard, ingress disabled\n- prometheus/values-prod.yaml: Grafana admin from vision-grafana-credentials secret, storageClass premium-rwo\n\n## Modified: environments/\n- dev.yaml: added frontend.enabled=true + ingress.enabled=true\n- local.yaml: added frontend.enabled=true + ingress.enabled=false\n- prod.yaml: added frontend.enabled=true + ingress.enabled=true\n\n## Modified: helmfile.yaml.gotmpl\n- Added vision-frontend release (./charts/frontend, needs: vision-app/vision-api)\n- Updated cloud provider comment: AWS EKS -> GKE\n- ingress-nginx controller release at version 4.10.1\n\n## Modified: frontend/index.html\n- Footer links (docs/metrics/health) changed from http://localhost:8000/* to /api/*\n- Now routes through nginx proxy, works correctly in all environments","tree":{"sha":"b