h every\nlayer on the map.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a7790a75f118d9fcb53b5075585f6498c4b626f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/git/trees/a7790a75f118d9fcb53b5075585f6498c4b626f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/git/commits/1a1d5701ff94978f2e8964c386792e9ce90fa5ba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/jknauernever/salish-prop/commit/1a1d5701ff94978f2e8964c386792e9ce90fa5ba","node_id":"C_kwDORPBA8toAKDFhMWQ1NzAxZmY5NDk3OGYyZTg5NjRjMzg2NzkyZTljZTkwZmE1YmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jknauernever/salish-prop/commit/9473dd12c9d40e5d2107b24153a4d28b50475247","sha":"9473dd12c9d40e5d2107b24153a4d28b50475247","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/commits/9473dd12c9d40e5d2107b24153a4d28b50475247"}],"sha":"1a1d5701ff94978f2e8964c386792e9ce90fa5ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/commits/1a1d5701ff94978f2e8964c386792e9ce90fa5ba"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/commits/9473dd12c9d40e5d2107b24153a4d28b50475247/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T00:33:59Z","email":"josh@knauernever.com","name":"Josh Knauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T00:33:59Z","email":"josh@knauernever.com","name":"Josh Knauer"},"message":"Layer info panels: structured definitions as a list (bold names, swatches, sub-definitions)\n\nNew LayerConfig.infoItems rendered by a shared LayerInfoBody in the legend,\nsidebar and sourcing modal. Shoreline Geology lists its seven groups with\neach class''s definition beneath; the run-on paragraph is gone.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8d027ad66e944fa30c38f35c714cd3446c511818","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/git/trees/8d02