map hides non-required attribution items\n- Eelgrass edge lines 4.5 px for easier clicking\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"40c9e302643eaffb3c94202a9dd4279ddddcedd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/git/trees/40c9e302643eaffb3c94202a9dd4279ddddcedd4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/git/commits/f5af4516140f9f284432b06899b393e893bc2f21","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/jknauernever/salish-prop/commit/f5af4516140f9f284432b06899b393e893bc2f21","node_id":"C_kwDORPBA8toAKGY1YWY0NTE2MTQwZjlmMjg0NDMyYjA2ODk5YjM5M2U4OTNiYzJmMjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jknauernever/salish-prop/commit/83007da0b99977ec2f1c6cb720a300a0fa36a4ed","sha":"83007da0b99977ec2f1c6cb720a300a0fa36a4ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/commits/83007da0b99977ec2f1c6cb720a300a0fa36a4ed"}],"sha":"f5af4516140f9f284432b06899b393e893bc2f21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/commits/f5af4516140f9f284432b06899b393e893bc2f21"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/commits/83007da0b99977ec2f1c6cb720a300a0fa36a4ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T16:26:32Z","email":"josh@knauernever.com","name":"Josh Knauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T16:26:32Z","email":"josh@knauernever.com","name":"Josh Knauer"},"message":"Legend: highlight layers actually in the map frame; visible Bull Kelp swatch\n\n- useLayersInView: on map idle, mark visible layers with at least one feature\n  intersecting the viewport (cached per-feature bounds; rasters count when in\n  zoom range). Legend rows get teal tint + accent bar when in view, fade with\n  \"not in view\" otherwise; header shows \"n of m in view\".\n- Kelp swatch draws the cream wash + squiggle instead of a 1