josh@knauernever.com","name":"Josh Knauer"},"message":"Fix Vercel deployment: remove LFS, host large files on GCS\n\n- Remove LFS wildcard tracking for *.geojson\n- Convert all small data files from LFS pointers to regular git objects\n- Remove Tax_Parcels.geojson (133MB) and friends-bull-kelp.json (395MB) from repo\n- Host those two files on GCS at gs://salish-ndvi-tiles/data/\n- Update layer configs to load from GCS URLs\n- Add large files to .gitignore\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ac58cc61f84dc52877cbed03da0957d6a34b4671","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/git/trees/ac58cc61f84dc52877cbed03da0957d6a34b4671"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/git/commits/4feceb83fa3af060136881a9922db3f616ff296a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/jknauernever/salish-prop/commit/4feceb83fa3af060136881a9922db3f616ff296a","node_id":"C_kwDORPBA8toAKDRmZWNlYjgzZmEzYWYwNjAxMzY4ODFhOTkyMmRiM2Y2MTZmZjI5NmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jknauernever/salish-prop/commit/8f45887b19f0900b9474aa641da197992fda4e87","sha":"8f45887b19f0900b9474aa641da197992fda4e87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/commits/8f45887b19f0900b9474aa641da197992fda4e87"}],"sha":"4feceb83fa3af060136881a9922db3f616ff296a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/commits/4feceb83fa3af060136881a9922db3f616ff296a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/commits/8f45887b19f0900b9474aa641da197992fda4e87/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-25T02:18:13Z","email":"josh@knauernever.com","name":"Josh Knauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-25T02:18:13Z","email":"josh@knauernever.com","name":"Josh Knauer"},"message":"Fix TypeScript build errors for Vercel deployment\n\n- Add google.maps to tsconfig types array\n- Fix null checks on bird tab element\n- Fix BBox type imports for Turf v7 compatibility\n- Fix buffer type to accept Polygon | MultiPolygon\n- Prefix unused variables with underscore\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2ca91a87d207c3ac3ae2257188dcb94466fb1eea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/git/trees/2ca91a87d207c3ac3ae2257188dcb94466fb1eea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/git/commits/8f45887b19f0900b9474aa641da197992fda4e87","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/jknauernever/salish-prop/commit/8f45887b19f0900b9474aa641da197992fda4e87","node_id":"C_kwDORPBA8toAKDhmNDU4ODdiMTlmMDkwMGI5NDc0YWE2NDFkYTE5Nzk5MmZkYTRlODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jknauernever/salish-prop/commit/d9556d7b040cd174f16eeb9559f98d2e7b6c019c","sha":"d9556d7b040cd174f16eeb9559f98d2e7b6c019c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/commits/d9556d7b040cd174f16eeb9559f98d2e7b6c019c"}],"sha":"8f45887b19f0900b9474aa641da197992fda4e87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/commits/8f45887b19f0900b9474aa641da197992fda4e87"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/commits/d9556d7b040cd174f16eeb9559f98d2e7b6c019c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-25T02:06:54Z","email":"josh@knauernever.com","name":"Josh Knauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-25T02:06:54Z","email":"josh@knauernever.com","name":"Josh Knauer"},"message":"Add site header/footer, Resources menu, Friends logo, and report improvements\n\n- Add Friends of the San Juans logo to header and footer across the app\n- Add Resources dropdown menu in header linking to both reports\n- Increase header height to 84px\n- Add site-wide footer with nonprofit disclosure text\n- Add consistent site header/footer to both HTML report pages\n- Re-crop all shoreline report images from PDF at 300 DPI\n- Redesign shoreline report with side-by-side desktop layout\n- Constrain hero section to content width, remove underwater banner\n- Add \"learn more\" links to Nearshore Ecology popup card\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4f8c772eab31344dfe7a4345499f3f08046f50ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/git/trees/4f8c772eab31344dfe7a4345499f3f08046f50ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/git/commits/d9556d7b040cd174f16eeb9559f98d2e7b6c019c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/jknauernever/salish-prop/commit/d9556d7b040cd174f16eeb9559f98d2e7b6c019c","node_id":"C_kwDORPBA8toAKGQ5NTU2ZDdiMDQwY2QxNzRmMTZlZWI5NTU5Zjk4ZDJlN2I2YzAxOWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jknauernever/salish-prop/commit/77d6e381cc006b45802b387a6bbbbee4dbb8cf39","sha":"77d6e381cc006b45802b387a6bbbbee4dbb8cf39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/commits/77d6e381cc006b45802b387a6bbbbee4dbb8cf39"}],"sha":"d9556d7b040cd174f16eeb9559f98d2e7b6c019c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/commits/d9556d7b040cd174f16eeb9559f98d2e7b6c019c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/commits/77d6e381cc006b45802b387a6bbbbee4dbb8cf39/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-24T16:09:51Z","email":"josh@knauernever.com","name":"Josh Knauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-24T16:17:00Z","email":"josh@knauernever.com","name":"Josh Knauer"},"message":"Add Friends of the San Juans data layers, eBird integration, and enhanced popup\n\n- Add 13 Friends of the San Juans vector layers (armor, boat ramps, bull kelp,\n  deepwater eelgrass, docks, forage fish spawning, groins, herring spawning,\n  marine railway, mooring buoys, pilings, shoreline geology) with custom marker\n  icons and collapsible sidebar categories\n- Add eBird API integration: Birds tab in parcel popup showing nearby species\n  observations with period/radius dropdowns, plus hotspot overlay layer\n- Add nearshore ecology analysis (eelgrass/kelp) to Summary tab with ecological\n  significance callouts styled with gradient backgrounds and teal accents\n- Add persistent parcel highlight overlay (orange border + fill) on click using\n  dedicated Data layer that survives viewport-filtered layer refreshes\n- Restructure Summary tab: side-by-side At a Glance + square mini-map layout\n- Update popup header to show resolved address and \"Overview Report\" subtitle\n- Update mini-map to use hybrid base with Map ID and orange parcel boundary\n- Add nearshore vegetation spatial query (bull kelp + eelgrass within 100ft buffer)\n- Add HTML report versions of kelp habitat and Living with the Shoreline PDFs\n  with extracted photos, PNW theming, and responsive design\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"271541ce62b58b86280d58d0973b6c66c8df2f16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/git/trees/271541ce62b58b86280d58d0973b6c66c8df2f16"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/git/commits/77d6e381cc006b45802b387a6bbbbee4dbb8cf39","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/jknauernever/salish-prop/commit/77d6e381cc006b45802b387a6bbbbee4dbb8cf39","node_id":"C_kwDORPBA8toAKDc3ZDZlMzgxY2MwMDZiNDU4MDJiMzg3YTZiYmJiZWU0ZGJiOGNmMzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jknauernever/salish-prop/commit/86e026c257fe2cffdb5e37beb6f80fa2a826bf3e","sha":"86e026c257fe2cffdb5e37beb6f80fa2a826bf3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/commits/86e026c257fe2cffdb5e37beb6f80fa2a826bf3e"}],"sha":"77d6e381cc006b45802b387a6bbbbee4dbb8cf39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/commits/77d6e381cc006b45802b387a6bbbbee4dbb8cf39"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/commits/86e026c257fe2cffdb5e37beb6f80fa2a826bf3e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-18T01:45:48Z","email":"josh@knauernever.com","name":"Josh Knauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-18T01:45:48Z","email":"josh@knauernever.com","name":"Josh Knauer"},"message":"Initial commit: Salish Sea Explorer property engagement tool\n\nReact/TypeScript/Vite app combining tax parcels, building footprints,\nfish habitat mapping, stormwater infrastructure, and NDVI vegetation\nanalysis for San Juan County. Includes Google Earth Engine cloud function\nfor Sentinel-2 seasonal composites and comprehensive documentation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b7471c5280d2e71a2ec88f37439b83d0b62f6f00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/git/trees/b7471c5280d2e71a2ec88f37439b83d0b62f6f00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/git/commits/86e026c257fe2cffdb5e37beb6f80fa2a826bf3e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/jknauernever/salish-prop/commit/86e026c257fe2cffdb5e37beb6f80fa2a826bf3e","node_id":"C_kwDORPBA8toAKDg2ZTAyNmMyNTdmZTJjZmZkYjVlMzdiZWI2ZjgwZmEyYTgyNmJmM2U","parents":[],"sha":"86e026c257fe2cffdb5e37beb6f80fa2a826bf3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/commits/86e026c257fe2cffdb5e37beb6f80fa2a826bf3e"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/jknauernever/salish-prop/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=5fa13f32ece53a39d73288dd9945e0aa30c62e99&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A21%3A39.200Z"}');
