"name":"Matthew McIntyre"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-18T05:17:08Z","email":"matthewtfm@gmail.com","name":"Matthew McIntyre"},"message":"Implemented modular Flask backend architecture, added safe dev-process cleanup + restart orchestration, renamed the frontend wrapper to UsageDashboard to better reflect current architecture, and consolidated provider fetching through useApiResource while removing legacy monolith files\n\n- Added modular backend (`backend/app.py`, `backend/get_model_limit_balances.py`, `backend/helpers/*`, `backend/config.py`) and new `run_api.py` entrypoint\n- Removed legacy monolith `check_openrouter_credit_balance_flask.py`\n- Added cleanup-first VS Code startup flow via new task chain and `cleanup-stale-dev-processes.ps1`\n- Updated debug launch config to use new prelaunch cleanup\n- Renamed `OpenRouterBalanceDashboard` -> `UsageDashboard` and `useOpenRouterBalanceDashboard` -> `useUsageDashboard`\n- Added centralized frontend API endpoints (`src/api/endpoints.js`)\n- Generalized fetch hook to `useApiResource` and removed provider-specific wrapper hooks\n- Updated docs to reflect architecture and startup/debug behavior","tree":{"sha":"4dfa73c13c4d0fc046a523ac296e78774c27d3ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mmcintyre123/openrouter-credit-status/git/trees/4dfa73c13c4d0fc046a523ac296e78774c27d3ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mmcintyre123/openrouter-credit-status/git/commits/5dac7622dc82f3390e383eb848ff46aa70ca912c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12388285?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmcintyre123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmcintyre123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmcintyre123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmcintyre123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_