/FishGit2020/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FishGit2020","id":58792632,"login":"FishGit2020","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NzkyNjMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/commits/f2f5bd2ae34984fb11fb31922dabdf8483cd0ebd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T21:58:39Z","email":"58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com","name":"FishGit2020"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T21:58:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ci): run firebase-tools isolated and pinned for deploy (#1083)\n\nThe deploy failed with ''Failed to authenticate'' because firebase-tools\nneeds google-auth-library@9, but running it from the pnpm workspace\n(pnpm exec) forced google-auth-library@10 (a hoisted direct repo dep),\nwhose breaking changes break Workload Identity auth. Run it via\n''pnpm dlx firebase-tools@15.16.0'' so it installs in isolation with its\nown v9 deps — reproducing the last known-good deploy. Pin 15.16.0 since\nunpinned npx pulls 15.17+, which regressed WIF auth independently.\n\nAlso removes the temporary deploy-debug diagnostic workflow.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"58ce8cc90459337ca034fc389b786bcb83a067d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/trees/58ce8cc90459337ca034fc389b786bcb83a067d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/commits/f2f5bd2ae34984fb11fb31922dabdf8483cd0ebd","verification":{"payload":"tree 58ce8cc90459337ca034fc389b786bcb83a067d2\nparent 576fb752a2f752e2c0fcc384969f32a15daec3b1\nauthor FishGit2020 <58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com> 1782683919 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782683919 -0700\n\nfix(ci): run firebase-tools isolated and pinned for deploy (#1083)\n\nThe deploy failed with ''Failed to authenticate'' because firebase-tools\nneeds google-auth-library@9, but running it from the pnpm workspace\n(pnpm exec) forced google-auth-library@10 (a hoisted direct repo dep),\nwhose breaking changes break Workload Identity auth. Run it via\n''pnpm dlx firebase-tools@15.16.0'' so it installs in isolation with its\nown v9 deps — reproducing the last known-good deploy. Pin 15.16.0 since\nunpinned npx pulls 15.17+, which regressed WIF auth independently.\n\nAlso removes the temporary deploy-debug diagnostic workflow.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqQZkPCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAv5QQABTSRyCYGL4tCqxGmKI5hkPv\n5nF9rmKXdRUqNjdeponC1x6IUNSFoLNQaQzGvBvCvZ3QIAB0tanT66n9HL6TBxJw\nClENqfAbZU93Byt968ky+X5Gw2jLjHrUERB5ci17Qj/8oLWoJyFhCo7Yx4EGdw7u\n88wII0wI6G/0dHl1j1OpR9hbaWeaN3caLqi/bUixBzYdtDy2QJ/nFMtQ6Ot2z5vb\nc01Lpuh5IS1ThZ8NOkBjcvn/o09XGNi4p025CfE2nON49WgGtUersZ5Fhf1fJ+jU\ncp1z/AUkpz5L69Zp0xcOlLYxmfF1cOUCxaIDxVXB+dkeWOQWP7wqd8dgPdtKTLru\nYCie+I7bLKTdQo5ThyDJQxqZbyK0feZ9PeXxQuXZi6xz8xateDYO6KhGDshXWyMb\nVzTdJNDOrzOChm0COpRPkJs1YE+c4DB7X5zZ51Pe89ifETnk6OKVmm5+kG4xJha7\nzkLS2JXoKITWXqL4OwkilY0pc9UBi/zDgRZrL2YKOapoyao33iaicjd3OvlXGdq/\nEx/ylNUag44WJtr8XmEJ5ZieyosogXalA7bq5i6HruFRJHAhm3YCUFAgvmJoGXQ2\nyX6zAXaq2hr/MqPUl8bHwLK+ECwWnDIb+SJgZA0WnXOskYJGVxdBnfWWpbftreIG\n2I0WdUbHIjXuAmcjuLYG\n=FKG6\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-28T21:58:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/pr