2bd189afc96a5a5d85dd745c2bb519","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/commits/22cd907a832bd189afc96a5a5d85dd745c2bb519"}],"sha":"08bc55accb04529957d7d1252319de757dfa8472","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/commits/08bc55accb04529957d7d1252319de757dfa8472"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58792632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FishGit2020","id":58792632,"login":"FishGit2020","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NzkyNjMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/commits/22cd907a832bd189afc96a5a5d85dd745c2bb519/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-30T22:42:47Z","email":"58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com","name":"FishGit2020"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T22:42:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(transit): restore OBA demo key fallback so resolvers keep responding (#1037)\n\nPR #1036 replaced the hard-coded `OBA_API_KEY = ''TEST''` with a strict env\nread and fail-closed behavior. That broke production: ''TEST'' is not a\nplaceholder, it''s OneBusAway''s documented public demo key, and removing\nthe fallback caused every transit query to return empty (stop-not-found\nbanners everywhere, no nearby search, favorites unable to load arrivals).\n\nThis restores ''TEST'' as the fallback when ONEBUSAWAY_API_KEY is unset, so\nthe existing demo-tier behavior keeps working while still allowing a\nproject-specific key via the API_KEYS Firebase secret bundle.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a124333c228f455699dffac218351141fd7c714c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/trees/a124333c228f455699dffac218351141fd7c714c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/commits/22cd907a832bd189afc96a5a5d85dd745c2bb519","verification":{"payload":"tree a124333c228f455699dffac218351141fd7c714c\nparent 1e03bf295bfcd7c8327cb587af266bafa422e93a\nauthor FishGit2020 <58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com> 1777588967 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777588967 -0700\n\nfix(transit): restore OBA demo key fallback so resolvers keep responding (#1037)\n\nPR #1036 replaced the hard-coded `OBA_API_KEY = ''TEST''` with a strict env\nread and fail-closed behavior. That broke production: ''TEST'' is not a\nplaceholder, it''s OneBusAway''s documented public demo key, and removing\nthe fallback caused every transit query to return empty (stop-not-found\nbanners everywhere, no nearby search, favorites unable to load arrivals).\n\nThis restores ''TEST'' as the fallback when ONEBUSAWAY_API_KEY is unset, so\nthe existing demo-tier behavior keeps working while still allowing a\nproject-specific key via the API_KEYS Firebase secret bundle.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp89rnCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAmu0QAFhfTPyrYu2gBdZ/LE5B7t0p\n74T3KBBzFzsH0F1C/uNUUDOyYbGDnvU8YLPq4XlrZINjUDi6+Pdnqz0gGX+iZKJ5\nMxeW77OVlB94a4hUB6+hAv3iskQ/CDdDOb3jXzKDk13OCvRiYMQoriKt5utAqrej\nugY6lYGLqvLYKhznEeFYAixhq3GUOtpFg/KuCxYmj18gkXJvwtuwTBLo714jiPrS