89afc96a5a5d85dd745c2bb519","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/commits/22cd907a832bd189afc96a5a5d85dd745c2bb519"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58792632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FishGit2020","id":58792632,"login":"FishGit2020","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NzkyNjMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/commits/1e03bf295bfcd7c8327cb587af266bafa422e93a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-30T00:41:40Z","email":"58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com","name":"FishGit2020"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T00:41:40Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(transit): cache recent stops, harden failure UX, secret-driven OBA key (#1036)\n\nReplaces the bare-IDs recent-stops list with a versioned localStorage cache\nthat carries name/direction/route badges so reopens render instantly with\nzero network calls. Splits useTransitArrivals'' single error field into\nerror vs refreshError so a failed manual refresh keeps the prior data on\nscreen with an inline retry. Surfaces distinct UI for denied/unavailable\ngeolocation, no-search-match, and stop-not-found, and removes stale-past\narrivals (>60s past omitted; ≤60s past labeled \"departed\"). Replaces the\nhard-coded OBA_API_KEY = ''TEST'' with a value read from the existing\nAPI_KEYS Firebase secret bundle; resolvers fail closed when absent.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1f182cbe5b7b5018409ae9df918d72cd987e3176","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/trees/1f182cbe5b7b5018409ae9df918d72cd987e3176"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/commits/1e03bf295bfcd7c8327cb587af266bafa422e93a","verification":{"payload":"tree 1f182cbe5b7b5018409ae9df918d72cd987e3176\nparent 238fcbae61319f9dfb338826c2305564728ecf19\nauthor FishGit2020 <58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com> 1777509700 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777509700 -0700\n\nfeat(transit): cache recent stops, harden failure UX, secret-driven OBA key (#1036)\n\nReplaces the bare-IDs recent-stops list with a versioned localStorage cache\nthat carries name/direction/route badges so reopens render instantly with\nzero network calls. Splits useTransitArrivals'' single error field into\nerror vs refreshError so a failed manual refresh keeps the prior data on\nscreen with an inline retry. Surfaces distinct UI for denied/unavailable\ngeolocation, no-search-match, and stop-not-found, and removes stale-past\narrivals (>60s past omitted; ≤60s past labeled \"departed\"). Replaces the\nhard-coded OBA_API_KEY = ''TEST'' with a value read from the existing\nAPI_KEYS Firebase secret bundle; resolvers fail closed when absent.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp8qVECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABRIQAEHzjG8pdRwfTJeKh+Py8ORq\n1rrvcVmy/sYJj67OpO2nUhrBOh+fOUz0VfQybj2WHhxj1vkUfs/UhIwc3EVgwx07\nZNKyoS/kjV8EmvpSI/O8KvA386aakW4BwO8njq4k2DvvCyCUiKjxcbLOa54Fk64X\nFq51X0ia7bAerutPbaqdhDcgw2cPBZ7Yi2d5qfopafRP1sqL8UO1Ph/hkkKnKnKN