/MyCircle/git/trees/7d56a84632746778c158cd227026e4972b4a1e01"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/commits/238fcbae61319f9dfb338826c2305564728ecf19","verification":{"payload":"tree 7d56a84632746778c158cd227026e4972b4a1e01\nparent c6f8736735cafe2b5619255190985857c9319d45\nauthor FishGit2020 <58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com> 1777312759 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777312759 -0700\n\nfix(sentry): disable reporting on localhost to filter preview noise (#1035)\n\nProduction-mode builds running on localhost (pnpm preview, firebase\nemulator) were emitting Firebase Installations and Analytics\n\"API key not valid\" errors to the production Sentry environment\n(2010+ events, 0 affected users). Real prod is unaffected.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp76P4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0W0QAKqEYL+CVitcK9swla5LM+kW\nU5og+FdffyfiEKAFEgMhOqsl91S8JabLZLDan/KpaAJqnCgL6/hE/6AZnzXv9SLD\nLTUS7r1xz64WwHjbDE1fG0l/wiZNMqkNgypeqhBmaWSktFk5f6pbOzPmTfy+B8io\nqK2nVJbpFzTxTavx3K+mq1Pk1cpgcgmeUhMebs+CZHRfGlsejq0XDLbnFe3uhQ5i\nHHrUVuYqAB69QS+6xXQA5joNdRiOAV7+c/iYV/u+cdTLeEaUqPhTkkecxwCbxnAA\nc7OHZ08lnrrEZgFxY+fHxtzCCYFKODUGhRUCHObOghyPog4QnoZNbPheCucIU5lL\ng9YnNT1T8h+oMgrDBGPRD9ZlnEwED/qrwJ3U/nlByEb0ILsAfqP+QVl/ZY45+ALY\nYn3Dn/WKAO6F+23B3X5Jc7a42kqGD/cTpJnirB6HZRXDWkY/xSFMXQJb+srsMgq1\nt1usA+OjrnSSQJf4bcT5glglAeGpZn8d13heuecN4rZwfKese6uFWsddAdPQLqlh\ne5LJdm+YXd5Ng67dxxbFrWh1WfgVPuoMYDj4L5aM/hh/hkl0vYNxceRSfP0DQxEC\nWUdtL+GL0zNx148woZUTFT+Cffz2hXHQD93K5ZCyByX4tbdYwVzEiw/auUS7f4zz\n/z0soK0XVc9mliaNV4wx\n=ofT9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-27T17:59:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.g