 passkey (WebAuthn) sign-in and registration (#1033)\n\nAdd passwordless authentication via passkeys using the WebAuthn standard.\n\n- Cloud Function (passkey.ts) with 4 endpoints for registration and\n  authentication flows, using @simplewebauthn/server\n- Passkey credentials stored in Firestore users/{uid}/passkeys subcollection\n- Authentication mints Firebase custom tokens for seamless sign-in\n- \"Sign in with Passkey\" button in AuthModal for discoverable credentials\n- \"Create Passkey\" option in UserMenu for logged-in users\n- Firestore collection group index for credential lookup\n- firebase.json rewrite for /passkey-api/** endpoint\n- i18n keys added to en, es, zh locales\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp75kfCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADvkQAG9+ZWZYTA5STUTAGFmxLxso\nHMrX5Vot+Mvn4jXErG5XK51rL+IgpdTfag3KTuHE2rk1Gn/PcIrD1mZtefjgr/eA\nt75wg2RdD9PmfgUi+1rZzoWU7mWZJ9R1xvEFBMRqelRgGdJZEZXW54w9rTeHpYdc\nUG+233H1ajOUJRngHRw6ULa0rjKaRauGzMJ77Q2XzfQnfOXGfI0mtS1Mid+HLMF+\nKVQ2X9baw4eUvduX2Mt9xHyd/pQ6sCdWFW6owZyIvKppBPfA2LvMwSUI0TwyafNH\n9akHpxwc3Yqhb3yHcCfYkv1mw/80+PiWbEd9H67D6GqC3TKqtBj/+Q9j1KSEdx6U\n+VDZyotFh4ATLzKxYaHHZa9ainsSkmH8GKMbOesMjzXue8k7sNsTFHirOgWQnauG\ne4cqI8fqLoAdNoVt/ZUulLIPeGulTFiOFQxXlu4hcswC+m0SmYqYwMFe+Y3lDAWw\nzH7CmABuUJDzxuIP8hFVRSRkANTo5UJMfKfOAzYjDYxoW65FN8IJSFon4L2J4s6x\nTvb/UmXy7Miu5TLENmC6wcLnxWhlwyZCLKGl3kRYdANgIExnf9vLGJn2UN+oL6gW\nOYpM/KPnKAFH75+2MwNwffF5fwUgOCbnxm5TG+8I0rBvyUXpJhtOu/0xn+THbdrV\nlfq//Piqp54P4pdEY95c\n=O4XL\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-27T17:13:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com