rs/FishGit2020/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/commits/4e80b14209a418c3630b83201a84119d85a23df5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-24T22:28:23Z","email":"58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com","name":"FishGit2020"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-24T22:28:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(hsa-expenses): add backup to NAS for HSA expenses and receipts (#1028)\n\nAdd a \"Backup to NAS\" button to the HSA Expenses page that copies all\nexpense metadata and receipt images to the NAS without removing them\nfrom Firestore or Firebase Storage (backup, not offload).\n\nNAS folder structure:\n  {destFolder}/hsa-backup/\n    hsa-expenses.json         ← complete metadata dump (all expenses)\n    receipts/{expenseId}/\n      {originalFileName}      ← receipt images/PDFs\n\nBackend:\n- New backupHsaToNas mutation that fetches all expenses + receipts,\n  writes summary JSON to NAS, and copies receipt files via WebDAV\n- Returns success status with expense/receipt counts\n\nFrontend:\n- \"Backup to NAS\" button in HSA header (visible when NAS connected)\n- Loading spinner during backup, success banner with counts\n- Updated test mocks for new hook fields\n\ni18n: 3 new keys in all 3 locales (en, es, zh)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9000a49c743b3ed960411ca8a1c8a477a18c8a18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/trees/9000a49c743b3ed960411ca8a1c8a477a18c8a18"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/commits/4e80b14209a418c3630b83201a84119d85a23df5","verification":{"payload":"tree 9000a49c743b3ed960411ca8a1c8a477a18c8a18\nparent 106966e92cf586a18f4aaf44da2c814b56363fc3\nauthor FishGit2020 <58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com> 1777069703 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777069703 -0700\n\nfeat(hsa-expenses): add backup to NAS for HSA expenses and receipts (#1028)\n\nAdd a \"Backup to NAS\" button to the HSA Expenses page that copies all\nexpense metadata and receipt images to the NAS without removing them\nfrom Firestore or Firebase Storage (backup, not offload).\n\nNAS folder structure:\n  {destFolder}/hsa-backup/\n    hsa-expenses.json         ← complete metadata dump (all expenses)\n    receipts/{expenseId}/\n      {originalFileName}      ← receipt images/PDFs\n\nBackend:\n- New backupHsaToNas mutation that fetches all expenses + receipts,\n  writes summary JSON to NAS, and copies receipt files via WebDAV\n- Returns success status with expense/receipt counts\n\nFrontend:\n- \"Backup to NAS\" button in HSA header (visible when NAS connected)\n- Loading spinner during backup, success banner with counts\n- Updated test mocks for new hook fields\n\ni18n: 3 new keys in all 3 locales (en, es, zh)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp6+6HCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABEIQAK1t7yx9e8YJzbilAbAGnpUE\nqTxlHJOSCsl9SFPfLBGP1v9hvIVHmURuwN5lNpfQuhzGMAz4k80gO92KYS+QPjBU\niItipu2sg+Ex9DyDWFEjuFB7L6P22aASOWz/nyuvvS9HyFgQ5D7PplGoHJ5RvXPx\n4dDwI+t+gtNto0kzBVI3okpWWfaRL7gzb9toDbjrPjwbussfUjLRakH/Tj4u9JUS\nloPh+0qDxjNv29VSectdRZSImpG8baeD+Qj5WMrHm5r2im/rYVfjj+8uQGMCIzZ1\nmexwJc3bQ31JmPD8rDBs02eD/9i1OrJ+E7827E+JylmkbR1CNX9WzOkJ23s9+mVp\nUJlf7cN40O1T3HiSkGihxUi1CLQQLs5IruJLjopJAALR6z5k9HoKGAEN9gAzB2VE\nNQv04tUuaDcchYNOzFc6ent/j9y8WkjKhSb0S4X1UVCiWRfIUr/HsjIb5lPU8Vwz\nFiOTBD9OVpRSsMNM9zoScNC/cuHm12m2P+yk4XIL736W/oevBzmLB3BxyuOf7kbD\nZiHq0unDHWfEwO6hYxdjvGvXl2c3cpzkrKWzamGiMvUeftADda6pYeBxp8UxtOIC\nk0BblPMnUjlJFX8LsMEMgoyxQYF08wyi8zsci3dIV5kSjM6lIuA61//SmGJcqxNT\nRqNShixq0b1kkeYbY7De\n=8z3i\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04