Git2020","id":58792632,"login":"FishGit2020","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NzkyNjMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/commits/106966e92cf586a18f4aaf44da2c814b56363fc3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-24T20:19:35Z","email":"58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com","name":"FishGit2020"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-24T20:19:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(cloud-files): add NAS offload and restore for cloud files (#1027)\n\nEnable users to offload cloud files to NAS storage and restore them\nback, mirroring the digital library''s NAS integration pattern.\n\nBackend:\n- Add nasArchived/nasPath fields to CloudFile GraphQL type\n- Add archiveCloudFileToNas, restoreCloudFileFromNas mutations\n- Add archiveAllCloudFilesToNas batch mutation (fire-and-forget)\n- Files stored as {destFolder}/cloud-files/{fileId}/{fileName} to\n  preserve original filenames on NAS filesystem\n- Update deleteFile resolver to handle NAS-only files\n\nFrontend:\n- NAS badge on file cards when archived to NAS\n- Per-file offload/restore buttons with loading spinners\n- Batch \"Offload All to NAS\" button with background polling\n- NAS connection status check via GET_NAS_CONNECTION_STATUS\n- Hint text when NAS is not connected\n\ni18n: 11 new keys added to all 3 locales (en, es, zh)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d8e7cd1a0f05a350c3b11eb4d717ccb85f96ade5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/trees/d8e7cd1a0f05a350c3b11eb4d717ccb85f96ade5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/commits/106966e92cf586a18f4aaf44da2c814b56363fc3","verification":{"payload":"tree d8e7cd1a0f05a350c3b11eb4d717ccb85f96ade5\nparent e637689369dc84585c3b62fa9b13e6567a9907b3\nauthor FishGit2020 <58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com> 1777061975 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777061975 -0700\n\nfeat(cloud-files): add NAS offload and restore for cloud files (#1027)\n\nEnable users to offload cloud files to NAS storage and restore them\nback, mirroring the digital library''s NAS integration pattern.\n\nBackend:\n- Add nasArchived/nasPath fields to CloudFile GraphQL type\n- Add archiveCloudFileToNas, restoreCloudFileFromNas mutations\n- Add archiveAllCloudFilesToNas batch mutation (fire-and-forget)\n- Files stored as {destFolder}/cloud-files/{fileId}/{fileName} to\n  preserve original filenames on NAS filesystem\n- Update deleteFile resolver to handle NAS-only files\n\nFrontend:\n- NAS badge on file cards when archived to NAS\n- Per-file offload/restore buttons with loading spinners\n- Batch \"Offload All to NAS\" button with background polling\n- NAS connection status check via GET_NAS_CONNECTION_STATUS\n- Hint text when NAS is not connected\n\ni18n: 11 new keys added to all 3 locales (en, es, zh)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp69BXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARKsQABIQqh25+FmKDrNPzvsi/Auj\nvW7LePm7c3TSftvkDJiYI2l0ou3wkpMgpLlTB6vHOpy+qRdIk0VAJTjnIm85mDVR\nGxcOJZclS1fVdwwJx5FvkZCiOZarQfmFAmLHym+Di/lHEelZsSe9MOrZ9OVK4bc+\nYmsSUe8kJZOjvNlURjCZy800RRhIj2qY2zqdM8eGZBrxtf2nq+hsdlwCyk2asYQl\nThG/aUo/UomhGBeMNrTdGT+1dvkTqA4aEu3jB0s/toDCHBDtmHxGKEJz/mUFyKGl\nu2jAdtzYh47mSXF+/Ri44yW8oDQc7+SD8Vn70PB5gHhXIpnwHVlr+YGif9LYXKs+\ncgKmEFGvsLjc37XjBq87sckkuD8EZb4fVwTRx0dSZorvNmAEIt4trNj8bilu+qj+\nWrjvR46Lwk1m+2qeRTdmI6