_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FishGit2020","id":58792632,"login":"FishGit2020","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NzkyNjMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/commits/e637689369dc84585c3b62fa9b13e6567a9907b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-22T22:14:28Z","email":"58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com","name":"FishGit2020"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-22T22:14:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(anniversary): prevent map pins from jumping to top-left on hover (#1024)\n\nMapLibre uses the marker element''s CSS `transform` property for\npositioning (translate). The highlight effect was overwriting it with\n`scale()`, destroying the position and sending pins to (0,0). Wrap\nthe visual dot in an inner element so MapLibre''s positioning on the\nouter element is never touched.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f64cac834efcef096244d06d697a8d6751a594f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/trees/f64cac834efcef096244d06d697a8d6751a594f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/commits/e637689369dc84585c3b62fa9b13e6567a9907b3","verification":{"payload":"tree f64cac834efcef096244d06d697a8d6751a594f8\nparent 7526130468b0f8f6026488628f18db94f13d47ae\nauthor FishGit2020 <58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com> 1776896068 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776896068 -0700\n\nfix(anniversary): prevent map pins from jumping to top-left on hover (#1024)\n\nMapLibre uses the marker element''s CSS `transform` property for\npositioning (translate). The highlight effect was overwriting it with\n`scale()`, destroying the position and sending pins to (0,0). Wrap\nthe visual dot in an inner element so MapLibre''s positioning on the\nouter element is never touched.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp6UhECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXL0QAGdZ5Fj5b5l/dXtVIVENzhsx\nbCR0sHqDtCx7uTdrXw6j7m1zTfF4n5cWqgZ0TBeu+ltu+l6S4/ZxFC+lNwgouyMw\nJrCIQcnTc4M2l3gwAogxtNNtnZ/ZEd6KB1/1rpO/tTjmu5xC9cl2lGbhj6G9Iq7X\nCKtZ9hqER2105RQO8EQq96IJCcBC/N9JC3vdSBcb9OJ3GZg98Q+cxw56mkaguC4e\n9T8TuDADfYg5VXqrvwzLhijJSQf+1dLHzk8bdyhoorvZvEIMDRAoZJzCdyd4jvZc\nAnLlCYWx1TjLA+6+iw1vQjP6EdKPqnJ5xO6UKZ4b4I5Bv8V7FQ0b+d6Ovx7nzt9x\nf3rDEAldkOvXO2R67IKhCFgLYMYNoDf2Apo0+ofnWApO0537fNQrhykGBt+86uez\nBzoqWS5a8ZBVYz4oAoKJloJqx2BD/WpvhOk/pYUxudYdU7qlmh83k+EW0YzYGBK2\nldjLzzQ+BdYrMPP4UT9QLFS34l7Sld3IzutzBqyjWVDLRfmNq5PbC57pezkaF8pv\nqLlKbCBmLrCoYAZixehK9OjBTf1yZ8YO9J8XBDD0cWTsTvluq5SwEshuLZPuC/4n\nO04m03F5ORYW4Yh/nwxnm5WZ9fUU3V/SvtqrJSBL436ToZzPHx+qL6UdKC985Zm1\nfvKr6THrI0xvZ+Wfia3l\n=Apm+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-22T22:14:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gr