ry-level location, use year locations instead (#1002)\n\nYear-level locations (including year 0) already cover the event location,\nmaking the anniversary-level location field redundant. Also shorten\n\"X days until next anniversary\" to \"X days\" on tiles to prevent truncation.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b9b7404892d73dab9942bb84790dd804a8d4081","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/trees/3b9b7404892d73dab9942bb84790dd804a8d4081"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/commits/11c11c6d94eab3f6021fab132239e4410bb2fd9b","verification":{"payload":"tree 3b9b7404892d73dab9942bb84790dd804a8d4081\nparent ee8749d2b7ef16898f3454383c987d04459c2e84\nauthor FishGit2020 <58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com> 1776091036 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776091036 -0700\n\nfeat(anniversary): remove anniversary-level location, use year locations instead (#1002)\n\nYear-level locations (including year 0) already cover the event location,\nmaking the anniversary-level location field redundant. Also shorten\n\"X days until next anniversary\" to \"X days\" on tiles to prevent truncation.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp3P+cCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAArKQQAGJd1x5b8lfS4MSvyRCkrqvY\n0RDe3Tj27w1TpEwYJY8+y+NbwDrdK/lKCc64BxWw5+xl9OsUxs7hrPnwz1sTqj64\nhUq1EpLzvyFUMk9sdagEEuF6/L1q9eFouQZ9COJvulMrWlvIHmqxqIrlAwreK13P\n9N0IGD754g+CSNbEij+MSju4Qy3ix7IjLfz1gnJNZc4AcABGxuIH6Rw3Ce6M5p21\nJ6UuK0h48alBKbMdHS6sOyEnbMV3jmWV8ZuvcN0KShss83qopTUDO9AP6EXnx0MQ\neN7n2ZC+C62FXHVGsgmgqWfDTo7VSnfdPjG+m98JTt6SC9onJ265t/Xc3VMIq6sM\nJk8XilY/GOi5+Ow4pajEj6Tawh7lbA5ADspgaG/s33IPgRxM8sN0KFVyXc/9n7l2\nnWouQv/UEkjtzSqFUmeONYJfKB9Ou92VUeSRHBENZj00skZGu6xIQykQvy1+sbh5\no4ljKc5gntvdcTv2l6kbYIpNNWSEo0eogAjaYO9wt1r5a62iLsiAOCQKkZA+ZHma\n3HLf5vpgTDEE8JW64NSv7jeVgJOsGRg5ptimseYR25uqUrrzdGiaAt5K