,"gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/FishGit2020/MyCircle/commit/ee8749d2b7ef16898f3454383c987d04459c2e84","node_id":"C_kwDORPGq3NoAKGVlODc0OWQyYjdlZjE2ODk4ZjM0NTQzODNjOTg3ZDA0NDU5YzJlODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/FishGit2020/MyCircle/commit/4c19d858b78dc05bb209314fed8dfa64bed74b49","sha":"4c19d858b78dc05bb209314fed8dfa64bed74b49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/commits/4c19d858b78dc05bb209314fed8dfa64bed74b49"}],"sha":"ee8749d2b7ef16898f3454383c987d04459c2e84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/commits/ee8749d2b7ef16898f3454383c987d04459c2e84"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58792632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FishGit2020","id":58792632,"login":"FishGit2020","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NzkyNjMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/commits/4c19d858b78dc05bb209314fed8dfa64bed74b49/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-12T20:56:49Z","email":"58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com","name":"FishGit2020"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-12T20:56:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(anniversary): start year for floating holidays + Columbus Day (#993)\n\n* feat(anniversary): add start year for floating holidays + Columbus Day preset\n\n- Add optional Start Year field when creating floating holiday\n  anniversaries, so \"years together\" calculates from the correct year\n  instead of defaulting to current year\n- Add Columbus Day (2nd Monday of October) to floating presets\n- Reorder presets chronologically (Jan → Nov)\n- i18n keys in all 3 locales\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(anniversary): add fixed-date US holiday quick-fill presets\n\nAdd quick-fill buttons for fixed-date holidays (New Year''s, Valentine''s,\nIndependence Day, Halloween, Veterans Day, Christmas) in the Fixed Date\nmode. Clicking sets the date and auto-fills the title if empty.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(anniversary): add maplibre-gl to federation shared config\n\nBuild failed because AnniversaryMap and LocationMapPicker dynamically\nimport maplibre-gl, but Rolldown couldn''t resolve it. Adding it to the\nshared federation config so the host provides it at runtime.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(anniversary): mark maplibre-gl as import:false in federation shared\n\nFederation plugin tried to resolve maplibre-gl as entry module but it''s\nnot a direct dependency. Using import:false so it''s only consumed at\nruntime from the host.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(anniversary): add maplibre-gl dependency for map components\n\nAnniversaryMap and LocationMapPicker dynamically import maplibre-gl but\nit wasn''t listed as a dependency. Rolldown couldn''t resolve the entry\nmodule during build. Added as a direct dependency (same as hiking-map).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dc1fa9025c25196114b89829cde8fd8114453d80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/trees/dc1fa9025c25196114b89829cde8fd8114453d80"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/commits/4c19d858b78dc05bb209314fed8dfa64bed74b49","verification":{"payload":"tree dc1fa9025c25196114b89829cde8fd8114453d80\nparent 2d0bc3f7528c077a51a01763dd3b5c586fb64959\nauthor FishGit2020 <58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com> 1776027409 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776027409 -0700\n\nfeat(anniversary): start year for floating holidays + Columbus Day (#993)\n\n* feat(anniversary): add start year for floating holidays + Columbus Day preset\n\n- Add optional Start Year field when creating floating holiday\n  anniversaries, so \"years together\" calculates from the correct year\n  instead of defaulting to current year\n- Add Columbus Day (2nd Monday of October) to floating presets\n- Reorder presets chronologically (Jan → Nov)\n- i18n keys in all 3 locales\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(anniversary): add fixed-date US holiday quick-fill presets\n\nAdd quick-fill buttons for fixed-date holidays (New Year''s, Valentine''s,\nIndependence Day, Halloween, Veterans Day, Christmas) in the Fixed Date\nmode. Clicking sets the date and auto-fills the title if empty.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(anniversary): add maplibre-gl to federation shared config\n\nBuild failed because AnniversaryMap and LocationMapPicker dynamically\nimport maplibre-gl, but Rolldown couldn''t resolve it. Adding it to the\nshared federation config so the host provides it at runtime.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(anniversary): mark maplibre-gl as import:false in federation shared\n\nFederation plugin tried to resolve maplibre-gl as entry module but it''s\nnot a direct dependency. Using import:false so it''s only consumed at\nruntime from the host.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(anniversary): add maplibre-gl dependency for map components\n\nAnniversaryMap and LocationMapPicker dynamically import maplibre-gl but\nit wasn''t listed as a dependency. Rolldown couldn''t resolve the entry\nmodule during build. Added as a direct dependency (same as hiking-map).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp3AcRCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjKYQAH492sh9FOsCJBwgeKn5+VMi\nTI3XLHjsm/4698w6T5Pr2X6mJXj9FHWJ+OBn1/F6ExjSlcnfo+Qgxm9D5zAPiw+i\nzkhIJYPfHx6ZwkW6uAz0WrFNW22KtqbWgI9MUk3hGaQtyEu9mTakbzL397ihp2Dm\nt3kLgHjPQz4kQzDELRnPhGhKDA+V0XRifqSM0hxc7c1tT3wekU5sYQGjVeNflIkM\nI0WAhnMS6DfwigJ/7fBG109LRAry+yUFy97ZUxvbpw3eQnXWSUZNcuAqlYFp5F0J\nG1OVGwyMh7kcOMqjmaowCHzgFDYrbLpV2AV2h+BxeMDlVTVRo29K71wKEdEQq5mE\nncA1+gS5BO6RsV+NnYPTqk8p8aHhJz/f+VmaLlPBVq7c2NVHsgim33lt48JQpC0X\ngUAsysqotITHfKDP8EMSOFn+UtTwQndNRmPONj/Txrynj7zKOnDQvnC5RWE568/3\nVnlRQXW4lDt4nTFTbXbNEAtMWRdfa1PxsPZJ4OXwcg/e9IW+wsVNmu9c1pXR9dw4\ndEzb0YSdrG15lXRllfzTk3MV8/XeQslbX8T4NWdnnKL1SHr5eDjDjlKfD9Q0Ng2C\nb6/B2U6i4Pz50EjIqPiWNWrw90cij4LFd4wdD/A/jRfwjtwIhnfVwOThDJGEyRHj\n7QfBhpNtGC