"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/commits/22910a00d7db9a9ad98faa605594b30eb53e0958/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-12T20:18:58Z","email":"58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com","name":"FishGit2020"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-12T20:18:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(anniversary): add floating holiday support (#992)\n\n* feat(anniversary): add floating holiday support for recurring dates\n\nSupport tracking holidays like Mother''s Day (2nd Sunday of May) that\nshift each year. Adds FloatingRule type to GraphQL schema, preset picker\nwith 7 common US holidays, custom rule builder, and floating-aware\ncountdown/display across list, detail, and widget views.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(anniversary): make floating date tests timezone-safe for CI\n\nUse local-time Date constructors and dynamic expected values to avoid\ntimezone drift between local dev (UTC-7) and CI (UTC).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Youpeng Huang <youpenghuang@Youpengs-MacBook-Pro.local>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cf01973dc2f3d5dd136e76885afaa545480d7b41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/trees/cf01973dc2f3d5dd136e76885afaa545480d7b41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/commits/22910a00d7db9a9ad98faa605594b30eb53e0958","verification":{"payload":"tree cf01973dc2f3d5dd136e76885afaa545480d7b41\nparent bc0ef007bc4f40133e33d867a5ce33281a09c4c2\nauthor FishGit2020 <58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com> 1776025138 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776025138 -0700\n\nfeat(anniversary): add floating holiday support (#992)\n\n* feat(anniversary): add floating holiday support for recurring dates\n\nSupport tracking holidays like Mother''s Day (2nd Sunday of May) that\nshift each year. Adds FloatingRule type to GraphQL schema, preset picker\nwith 7 common US holidays, custom rule builder, and floating-aware\ncountdown/display across list, detail, and widget views.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(anniversary): make floating date tests timezone-safe for CI\n\nUse local-time Date constructors and dynamic expected values to avoid\ntimezone drift between local dev (UTC-7) and CI (UTC).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Youpeng Huang <youpenghuang@Youpengs-MacBook-Pro.local>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp2/4yCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAC8kQAF78Nil/PzwGu8Ofwj62hwRq\nKixmofai5AMRF/dJrZSDrW/oIC6uBWZi2Fk3UTyKw8E0BjxCdDWWxsSQa8+WGffu\nuCmWV2uqtCY+azUyt6BaSvK940mWJ/yQwZj9QXS5KE4rDy60LEf+J/DRqCfYVPyo\nGMrfgXszClvoqovFpL8k2e+Mf9ayaHGj4BcRkIFq2Egj2ClGKSr926zQRHqZushN\nd/9AWfef4Jbbz6Wn/2y8SPaMOApo6X0hdGTB4+dkr5ooJW8nyEe7c6gus8b7xDAG\nuLVmUqNnkfGIfqKlWnnYSZjdCp2z8NSUFggAkg/HbqPgPADFImeObzwfWNTogMdY\nPpVuP1KCORZIt/CaC4OgH0TWDN73CPCYeDun0qUSrNb3CnigqGl84Z80a7SijAJF\n9WodpvGOqZiD6qDIPMnN0Ux25K7tCbdOglst6ihSsYoXuRSp1k6A3wEfzPxClVci\nFBlyOPj626W/wJ3ZxdZ/vhW7d6MXG3VkI4JYCGCmR4VT7ulV2qISabHRR+Xn8pz+\na3O+Ug6fnynqAMDp2TgjJWny5UZZNLo5RZbPBHYrA9sGqgCgJhhveomrai8PK606\nwfgiwobi2JLOGHLe37++t3UehIY1jSuKKyMfjMBl55DB5ZAHG1qq9DK1mwOIkQEt\nZYCA1BjfXMdMk0dffP3S\n=TbYx\n-----EN