6-04-10T16:40:54Z","email":"58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com","name":"FishGit2020"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T16:40:54Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(digital-library): add recycle bin with restore and permanent delete (#985)\n\n* fix(digital-library): disable audio conversion when EPUB is offloaded to NAS\n\nTTS conversion downloads the EPUB from Firebase Storage to extract\nchapter text. If the EPUB has been offloaded to NAS, the file is gone\nand conversion silently fails. Now disables both batch and per-chapter\nconvert buttons when epubNasArchived is true, with an explanatory\nmessage telling the user to restore the EPUB first.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(digital-library): add recycle bin UI + disable convert when EPUB offloaded\n\n- Add deletedBooks GraphQL query + resolver\n- Add recycle bin section to library landing page with restore and\n  permanent delete buttons (collapsible, shows count)\n- Disable batch and per-chapter audio conversion when EPUB is offloaded\n  to NAS with explanatory message\n- i18n keys in all 3 locales\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"06c27b3f9c6261002f04ea29392560f170a8d039","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/trees/06c27b3f9c6261002f04ea29392560f170a8d039"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/commits/f3cf001c4d43dd2169e87e78b75a70f44219f8a6","verification":{"payload":"tree 06c27b3f9c6261002f04ea29392560f170a8d039\nparent 91a1ae8532b8583265fa05d9a1989d90bd9b6216\nauthor FishGit2020 <58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com> 1775839254 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775839254 -0700\n\nfeat(digital-library): add recycle bin with restore and permanent delete (#985)\n\n* fix(digital-library): disable audio conversion when EPUB is offloaded to NAS\n\nTTS conversion downloads the EPUB from Firebase Storage to extract\nchapter text. If the EPUB has been offloaded to NAS, the file is gone\nand conversion silently fails. Now disables both batch and per-chapter\nconvert buttons when epubNasArchived is true, with an explanatory\nmessage telling the user to restore the EPUB first.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(digital-library): add recycle bin UI + disable convert when EPUB offloaded\n\n- Add deletedBooks GraphQL query + resolver\n- Add recycle bin section to library landing page with restore and\n  permanent delete buttons (collapsible, shows count)\n- Disable batch and per-chapter audio conversion when EPUB is offloaded\n  to NAS with explanatory message\n- i18n keys in all 3 locales\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp2SgWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADawQAKZHRoQkmTof19DU1jR240qT\ngU2I/GsVH86vovHIsSdothJoBAPbofgFO7KGtJlHZ/ApTDM0lCjZHGei5VA0HsLt\n2YDbMlGZg3g9DQd3PMYRF3JSJuPsAMlAEallyMhoQY16NEWM2LBZEkmwdRhWftVI\n4Eajo9H/Hm0ZyKyGDA2oJuZ0mMUg55G1I1jdEqgMItOmv2TsDGpscnaHwW1GR32Z\nFM3bNcHSEE34340zLWcRnxFk4IeNDB9Dp+EOr4XAD5SeNMe7bWKTEAOvzFrbC9+E\nZwBrM29XnmUSnE4tRNuBJQjxH3vsSmfsiLr13qEQD5UPz0XYfB3YRiBDaiGILWIm\nMigy055GkBoubzgxPUJ6Ucx0xCJeVbxPQD2ywEX2MyfVC9bCbV8bvHZU8pGdgYw3\nZNwtFteWOV5NLCHr5SQuMEjXEbmkCuTk17erORjyq2xvs+N4VYbTaud9CYJZ2zU+\nhkyNGkmplUPz3qpDXPkWTkDD6CVOGDF7Eo0CNdd8+nfpjLJpY1MbsDQcIe7Bv1MO\njFpVQRUgW8jqVKcoAv6FmyjCtwKUAwQ9ZD5uyG8pngUxOqAfxavP6ytMlJJg5cF2\n6JeMtH+4ftofGePHyE9vbx5AQCRvaGxy0jt77RDCtUThwc/frCETnzuyN0c3m2SY\n0t8ViYBlvRhq59Jas0ZQ\n=H28i\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-10T16:40:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https: