m","name":"FishGit2020"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T16:20:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(digital-library): keep NAS offload spinner active during batch + fix autoPlay default (#983)\n\n- NAS \"Offload All\" button spinner was clearing immediately after the\n  mutation returned, even though the backend was still archiving chapters\n  in the background. Now keeps batchOffloading=true until the poll\n  detects all chapters are archived.\n- Fix autoPlay always being set to ''1'' when navigating to listen tab,\n  even without explicit autoPlay param. Now only preserves autoPlay\n  if already present in the URL.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"804745557ce9bbf3cb24510c49dc807a67adaf0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/trees/804745557ce9bbf3cb24510c49dc807a67adaf0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/commits/7d9b85357f74174fb7bc23878b11967c45bb0dbe","verification":{"payload":"tree 804745557ce9bbf3cb24510c49dc807a67adaf0c\nparent 96a59fb96faabb678be8b6b9f8cd3ee89eff7424\nauthor FishGit2020 <58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com> 1775838051 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775838051 -0700\n\nfix(digital-library): keep NAS offload spinner active during batch + fix autoPlay default (#983)\n\n- NAS \"Offload All\" button spinner was clearing immediately after the\n  mutation returned, even though the backend was still archiving chapters\n  in the background. Now keeps batchOffloading=true until the poll\n  detects all chapters are archived.\n- Fix autoPlay always being set to ''1'' when navigating to listen tab,\n  even without explicit autoPlay param. Now only preserves autoPlay\n  if already present in the URL.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp2SNjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASCoQAIXoOB