fb96faabb678be8b6b9f8cd3ee89eff7424","sha":"96a59fb96faabb678be8b6b9f8cd3ee89eff7424","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/commits/96a59fb96faabb678be8b6b9f8cd3ee89eff7424"}],"sha":"7d9b85357f74174fb7bc23878b11967c45bb0dbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/commits/7d9b85357f74174fb7bc23878b11967c45bb0dbe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58792632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FishGit2020","id":58792632,"login":"FishGit2020","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NzkyNjMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/commits/96a59fb96faabb678be8b6b9f8cd3ee89eff7424/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T16:04:33Z","email":"58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com","name":"FishGit2020"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T16:04:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(nas): resolve audio storage path from URL when audioStoragePath missing (#981)\n\nBatch conversion worker stored audio as chapter-N.mp3 (no zero-padding)\nbut didn''t set audioStoragePath. The NAS offload fallback assumed\nchapter-000N.mp3 (padded), causing \"file not found\" errors.\n\nNow extracts the real path from audioUrl as a fallback. Also fixes the\nbatch worker to set audioStoragePath for future conversions.\n\nCo-authored-by: Youpeng Huang <youpenghuang@Youpengs-MacBook-Pro.local>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d3ed82b066afbd4acb6ffec3778d7b06e2f2f0fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/trees/d3ed82b066afbd4acb6ffec3778d7b06e2f2f0fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/commits/96a59fb96faabb678be8b6b9f8cd3ee89eff7424","verification":{"payload":"tree d3ed82b066afbd4acb6ffec3778d7b06e2f2f0fc\nparent 063bd72d15b78768e904f5c50d23408609112acb\nauthor FishGit2020 <58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com> 1775837073 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775837073 -0700\n\nfix(nas): resolve audio storage path from URL when audioStoragePath missing (#981)\n\nBatch conversion worker stored audio as chapter-N.mp3 (no zero-padding)\nbut didn''t set audioStoragePath. The NAS offload fallback assumed\nchapter-000N.mp3 (padded), causing \"file not found\" errors.\n\nNow extracts the real path from audioUrl as a fallback. Also fixes the\nbatch worker to set audioStoragePath for future conversions.\n\nCo-authored-by: Youpeng Huang <youpenghuang@Youpengs-MacBook-Pro.local>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp2R+RCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZgcQAH9thy6eYmLk0Lll4ZgnKygM\nDryHcHRg5BRDljSB38mYSL9BtpLdZXLwTfQ0MCKWKkiL5G1YRVBaJNo7xqJw6LHB\nOZ00IIBEF3pLqAMX4apYWmGN0+EuwtLkbfHEZScA91c9N55533JugfnnEd5yvvjY\nSx1QKOprw6Uhz7CxucnnLeGcHnV3ROluJvY7eH92EUoh57hgSyWhYPBtjQBYyXmq\niSbn73G2qlGkwCFW8ndj2aC4STOc3UesEqet7XtXF9ywLLTKWKi/FYzmAgbVjUOO\nd+xFQVfsjpN/HSjhPSEWS9mXAaZeqiCjDXJjQHBsYJe1khDP/KnJAU2Ai1V0UY35\nH2oxV5J2NNSTe3kfh56cIafzRkxcXtdl8RhoNgpSqzYtIFlSEuNAy8PVsKzdJ0hD\n/9cpLyLrFI2mw9nFWtwoXQUqsgS8LVXpm3qPlcCEPIMPttahaG8PqZujAKReYJGL\nF0Aee/FL2cOEZMHRw2+5