Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(nas): skip re-upload when NAS already has file, allow re-offload after restore\n\nWhen offloading audio/EPUB that was previously restored from NAS, skip\nthe download+upload cycle and just delete from Firebase Storage to free\nspace. Also show offload buttons for restored files so users can free\nFirebase Storage again.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Youpeng Huang <youpenghuang@Youpengs-MacBook-Pro.local>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e30a57a038c4ca779e0971ce9d1eeedb61c0eb32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/trees/e30a57a038c4ca779e0971ce9d1eeedb61c0eb32"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/commits/86a03fbc49519be67f085712bc9628ae26ad3801","verification":{"payload":"tree e30a57a038c4ca779e0971ce9d1eeedb61c0eb32\nparent 35cc8ca502d505aa2794c0c4e2c5c72e94d3e564\nauthor FishGit2020 <58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com> 1775830022 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775830022 -0700\n\nfeat(digital-library): add ZIP download button to listen tab toolbar (#980)\n\n* feat(digital-library): add ZIP download button to listen tab toolbar\n\nAdds \"Generate Audiobook ZIP\" / \"Download ZIP\" button next to the\n\"Offload All to NAS\" button in ChapterConvertList. Shows status\n(generating, ready, error) with polling during generation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(nas): skip re-upload when NAS already has file, allow re-offload after restore\n\nWhen offloading audio/EPUB that was previously restored from NAS, skip\nthe download+upload cycle and just delete from Firebase Storage to free\nspace. Also show offload buttons for restored files so users can free\nFirebase Storage again.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\