 i18n keys for widget tile (#978)\n\nThe anniversary dashboard widget showed raw i18n keys and static text\ninstead of interpolated countdown values. Added 3 missing keys\n(loading, yearsTogether, createFirst) and fixed daysUntil/happyAnniversary\nto include {{days}}/{{years}} interpolation params in all 3 locales.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"59cac8bcf7ce43cb893d22ab20861b9bf2ae20e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/trees/59cac8bcf7ce43cb893d22ab20861b9bf2ae20e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/commits/35cc8ca502d505aa2794c0c4e2c5c72e94d3e564","verification":{"payload":"tree 59cac8bcf7ce43cb893d22ab20861b9bf2ae20e4\nparent e643edb40ea884a88a2fc12a3c6e46905f6246fd\nauthor FishGit2020 <58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com> 1775828820 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775828820 -0700\n\nfix(anniversary): add missing i18n keys for widget tile (#978)\n\nThe anniversary dashboard widget showed raw i18n keys and static text\ninstead of interpolated countdown values. Added 3 missing keys\n(loading, yearsTogether, createFirst) and fixed daysUntil/happyAnniversary\nto include {{days}}/{{years}} interpolation params in all 3 locales.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp2P9UCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAUjkQABQR7IMu13P628cZIdHC36fZ\ne4GMV3UOcI4D8fZmDxiLUJVQjS2qu/1W3JtYop6PN+EIPH+VPl/7/tM15vfDQv74\nvCAXG4PqbBiKchm3mw8TSooW9oWtE0B4Yg/d+QP1k7HQgQ2s5K/hpUMWSYq/njTq\nSRAd8hS1+tk7EUpe4kN94LyS0N46oKPxc/qdEEKaSqrO5TxpcNywBxO9KZBqr/as\nrrCVgL7VwFPhjrO2OmXpRB3tV6lnD8wZnkUSQzp93sb8Qce4a8YrClMV06EdY+jO\nQ2OzhI4wpCIIN/k6rZopm9R9j8NrDo2CzKcRBkO/jw+qZ+b4uPD5bN9MI/yitd1H\nxAv6wjBlkWqiYC+cttgx0RjdsfnpOZjd5g2ETpFeYYuPDlvPdXvbMHNSTiJzQzYg\nHi15bp+NxWKjBq3sbS2kdPnDM6pOTWhe4vBUMWwAaG9ixP9qY4+OU8vh6bXsOu7D\n2rVJPT3JQ5G/sExU/WrX9FrDohTV40sfx30WrIthI+ub6sjO5zqu1FbG