tarred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/commits/de7bd949da04b39c3ab55ca0970dfa7b860433b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T13:37:50Z","email":"58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com","name":"FishGit2020"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T13:37:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: add ZIP generate loading state and function logging (#976)\n\n* fix(digital-library): add loading state to ZIP generate button\n\nShow spinner + disabled state on the Generate ZIP button while the\nmutation is in-flight, so users get immediate visual feedback.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(functions): add logging to zipWorker, resumeParseWorker, resumeTailor\n\nzipWorker had zero logging — impossible to debug processing/timeout\nissues. Added logger at job start, per-chapter download progress,\narchive creation, upload, and completion. Also filled logging gaps in\nresumeParseWorker and resumeTailor for job entry, text extraction,\nAI calls, and success paths.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"efdea1a72f65d1aea4de3306efe73b70a98b6b97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/trees/efdea1a72f65d1aea4de3306efe73b70a98b6b97"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/commits/de7bd949da04b39c3ab55ca0970dfa7b860433b8","verification":{"payload":"tree efdea1a72f65d1aea4de3306efe73b70a98b6b97\nparent 5225027fbafe4079fae18b614a2104a89d3e7da3\nauthor FishGit2020 <58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com> 1775828270 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775828270 -0700\n\nfix: add ZIP generate loading state and function logging (#976)\n\n* fix(digital-library): add loading state to ZIP generate button\n\nShow spinner + disabled state on the Generate ZIP button while the\nmutation is in-flight, so users get immediate visual feedback.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(functions): add logging to zipWorker, resumeParseWorker, resumeTailor\n\nzipWorker had zero logging — impossible to debug processing/timeout\nissues. Added logger at job start, per-chapter download progress,\narchive creation, upload, and completion. Also filled logging gaps in\nresumeParseWorker and resumeTailor for job entry, text extraction,\nAI calls, and success paths.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp2P0vCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOukQACXUpO6b4ApjFKnCXH4DI7Z9\n0VHcKLWgYpFS08oOO2Tc9XGv7tQraiDT7xr47w5US57aCHK6nL6MuNI3frdNzkuL\nQLVPbW6xr5wxZB7gj1nvytmTL/lTQEmDUQpJoPaw2rJRq2NwEp49N7MOzFS8M1qk\ndWe5bKRcFsu8iIoM/uwOmp5btdY3kX5ZGk9gf9HELj/GGXoy6ECev2QA2WkKFN+G\n5oOsMxsp0ABOYOsSu/BF5ftK7Jh3t0klD9TGwyoBTBuqEVniS+rNrCZyPmcq/W+r\npZi1anSyzqPzBDq9YGespV4xDgtbpPs3EWyUcldfNTwOh8fm7Rum67eoDldrThXX\n2RgKUr4x5LBI70QNkL5oLoSizi8GsgwCjMMV3+or0jCwWg+6QM4YDsEc52+brlpf\nhNyEAAgmk82mzcpPCRGsB4CS2UPNuFVhqdcDwVFcaf2wnv26xunIOkAKXzDpDmy5\nikGxHNXfLBx4eUymDD2wcvjXpX1CnluQ0P5NDvwxm4nA3kRcD8m2AKCm0QaMScqx\nCZwEp2b/ArxPCjhnHRfX6GQbZCSS1im573at9xZHlCUcjO98gDJUbCsEeZU4Yysg\njWKB/Y8gTb5lHVxnkFNks/RmaeTHpcvlJhRa6xiMVRgLj5tvUO663BoIS7G2GWTS\nctA/P4geiWtA42RZG/T9\n=8EYA\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-10T13:37:51Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following