s://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/commits/5225027fbafe4079fae18b614a2104a89d3e7da3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T13:32:32Z","email":"58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com","name":"FishGit2020"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T13:32:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: sync pnpm-lock.yaml with package.json (#975)\n\n* fix: sync pnpm-lock.yaml with package.json\n\nLockfile had axios ^1.15.0 but package.json specifies ^1.14.0, causing\nfrozen-lockfile CI failures.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(nas): use audioStoragePath from Firestore instead of reconstructing path\n\nSome chapters have audio stored at a path that doesn''t match the\nzero-padded naming convention. Use the actual audioStoragePath field\nfrom the chapter document, falling back to the constructed path.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Revert \"fix(nas): use audioStoragePath from Firestore instead of reconstructing path\"\n\nThis reverts commit db472c5099c03668ff43d52ab7c133ad5b364660.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Youpeng Huang <youpenghuang@Youpengs-MacBook-Pro.local>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"486981e7bb6c18498ff096d6948196e1f7eef17f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/trees/486981e7bb6c18498ff096d6948196e1f7eef17f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/commits/5225027fbafe4079fae18b614a2104a89d3e7da3","verification":{"payload":"tree 486981e7bb6c18498ff096d6948196e1f7eef17f\nparent 78b43fea39