hGit2020/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FishGit2020","id":58792632,"login":"FishGit2020","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NzkyNjMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/commits/3e31b1417a88e27d4a14206c8d93e9a395d66382/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-09T22:02:09Z","email":"58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com","name":"FishGit2020"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-09T22:02:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(anniversary): add Anniversary Tracker MFE (#968)\n\n* feat(anniversary): add Anniversary Tracker MFE with full stack implementation\n\nNew micro-frontend for tracking anniversaries with per-user ownership and\ncontributor sharing. Includes landing page with list + map, drilldown page\nwith yearly timeline, picture gallery, contributor management, dashboard\nwidget, and full navigation integration.\n\n- GraphQL schema + resolvers for CRUD, picture upload, contributor mgmt\n- Firestore rules for owner + contributor access control\n- i18n keys in all 3 locales (en/es/zh)\n- Shell integration: routes, nav (Family group), widget, command palette\n- 20+ integration points: Dockerfile, assemble script, vitest aliases, etc.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(anniversary): export generated Anniversary types from shared barrel\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(anniversary): add missing index.html, test file, and spec directory\n\n- Add index.html entry point (required for vite build)\n- Add minimal test file (vitest exits 1 with no tests)\n- Add docs/specs/027-anniversary/ to satisfy spec-check CI\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Youpeng Huang <youpenghuang@Youpengs-MacBook-Pro.local>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dd618c1cdd204e7d05c8fde3be0bef58f9ac1418","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/trees/dd618c1cdd204e7d05c8fde3be0bef58f9ac1418"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/commits/3e31b1417a88e27d4a14206c8d93e9a395d66382","verification":{"payload":"tree dd618c1cdd204e7d05c8fde3be0bef58f9ac1418\nparent 710d63745cb511dff5ba126d1984a8825fdd7619\nauthor FishGit2020 <58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com> 1775772129 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775772129 -0700\n\nfeat(anniversary): add Anniversary Tracker MFE (#968)\n\n* feat(anniversary): add Anniversary Tracker MFE with full stack implementation\n\nNew micro-frontend for tracking anniversaries with per-user ownership and\ncontributor sharing. Includes landing page with list + map, drilldown page\nwith yearly timeline, picture gallery, contributor management, dashboard\nwidget, and full navigation integration.\n\n- GraphQL schema + resolvers for CRUD, picture upload, contributor mgmt\n- Firestore rules for owner + contributor access control\n- i18n keys in all 3 locales (en/es/zh)\n- Shell integration: routes, nav (Family group), widget, command palette\n- 20+ integration points: Dockerfile, assemble script, vitest aliases, etc.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(anniversary): export generated Anniversary types from shared barrel\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(anniversary): add missing index.html, test file, and spec directory\n\n- Add index.html entry point (required for vite build)\n- Add minimal test file (vitest exits 1 with no tests)\n- Add docs/specs/027-anniversary/ to satisfy spec-check CI\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Youpeng Huang <youpenghuang@Youpengs-MacBook-Pro.local>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp2CHhCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3+gQAHp5ysgRZ225sDnXs+2CFsKO\n/sfGhBNhCqGAys9LWrva//9FUqbkqH9YDA02gQYgXFmsOj4IKm3Omngf24+3AB7Y\nTH3t2ktSfsfTr/Rcv0/61jSqiUA1Xk+Gu/lHUv3q1Vm/cMRxLBiTVlG4IqY32iEq\nExoR2IqoRlQNqvqF0m9OBP/5ekbHkC4uA46U8BKT9CY0f91ioX7oyet2BDZ5Z2kO\nPCtS/532LwrIkVI/1cx9A5VwFg1UM5KwbT4SXKGbbp4+DWudvhTNNF+v/6JaOzIe\nTu6Rc1ioj2CeN1lObRORbMkfUkQFFhxDoKVCwLWJ1LD3ZT9qbA70qJLLj3Uh14l5\nlDPSDWJECNWCHw1N/vqhD14AF9+Zu2/T50+ei11iwbZlxunLAwWmkknMAIRfwjEp\nt9fZYy/s5MeO4O3YOwLvLuom06ZxX94hzpKJiRpOZQYTplZWu2BOVMgG9TVz5C2h\ngT23kGwsqd5Q/2mXDgzsRRJEiK4DRRWz0qWcr4E8cTfQszltUKzyrDqGZ6iPCx8q\nKx6fxjM9S4jPdqjJU/jG5/1+zhALGQT5MMOwdHBeLc1BfbfBXX8SRs+aysmtqpOR\nXlOEc7ZX9IHmKPs/zmSEt+QnENc+2rmVcSVeBPDpN+oMlQSKh2cJuWGe/k/b/RHr\nK2EyoaOGbvP5Dhj26jES\n=gRMu\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-09T22:02:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-fl