iewer): add session history, progress analytics, bulk import/export, and timed mode\n\n- SessionHistoryPanel: browse past sessions with chapter/date filtering, re-run, and delete\n- ProgressDashboard: per-dimension score bar charts across sessions\n- TimerControl: configurable countdown timer (20/30/45 min presets) with auto-end on expiry\n- QuestionManager: export questions to JSON and import from file with deduplication\n- useSessionHistory hook: wraps GET_INTERVIEW_SESSIONS with chapter/date filter state\n- useQuestionBank: adds exportQuestions and importQuestions callbacks\n- useInterviewChat: timer state management with stale-closure-safe endInterviewRef pattern\n- AiInterviewer: wires all new features together with Progress and Sessions panels\n- All 65 ai-interviewer tests passing (268 total across monorepo)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(security): bump vite override to >=7.3.2 to resolve GHSA-p9ff-h696-f583 and GHSA-v2wj-q39q-566r\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"da963c57d23ea6f4150cc8e7e90d082b33bc3971","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/trees/da963c57d23ea6f4150cc8e7e90d082b33bc3971"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/commits/7d0de2381224150f38cb402f3143bacc48750f83","verification":{"payload":"tree da963c57d23ea6f4150cc8e7e90d082b33bc3971\nparent f0367ba0f18d0eef76890fca03d2a77b6ebe3d06\nauthor FishGit2020 <58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com> 1775593178 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775593178 -0700\n\nfeat(ai-interviewer): session history, progress analytics, import/export, and timed mode (#959)\n\n* feat(hsa-expenses): add download button for image receipts\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(ai-interviewer): add session history, progress analytics, bulk import/export, and timed mode\n\n