EST Cloud Function into the existing\nGraphQL resolver. Auth is now handled by Apollo context (same as all\nother HSA mutations) — no more window.__getFirebaseIdToken wiring needed.\n\nRemoves the hsaExpenses Cloud Function, its firebase.json rewrite, and\nall fetch() calls in useHsaExpenses.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8143aea33072bd1d13c36bf3046117ddd468783b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/trees/8143aea33072bd1d13c36bf3046117ddd468783b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/commits/873f7216c6e03ea968c9b8b6ae4fc6685a0d7f96","verification":{"payload":"tree 8143aea33072bd1d13c36bf3046117ddd468783b\nparent 0fbc64a183cdb4408990bc5f144caaf299543400\nauthor FishGit2020 <58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com> 1775586453 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775586453 -0700\n\nrefactor(hsa-expenses): migrate receipt upload/delete to GraphQL (#957)\n\n* fix(hsa-expenses): use __getFirebaseIdToken not __getIdToken for auth\n\nShell exposes window.__getFirebaseIdToken but upload hook was calling\nwindow.__getIdToken (undefined), causing all uploads to 401.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor(hsa-expenses): migrate receipt upload/delete from REST to GraphQL\n\nAdds uploadHsaReceipt and deleteHsaReceipt GraphQL mutations, moving the\nlogic from the old /hsa-expenses REST Cloud Function into the existing\nGraphQL resolver. Auth is now handled by Apollo context (same as all\nother HSA mutations) — no more window.__getFirebaseIdToken wiring needed.\n\nRemoves the hsaExpenses Cloud Function, its firebase.json rewrite, and\nall fetch() calls in useHsaExpenses.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\