ic2any (pure-JS decoder) which works in all\nbrowsers regardless of native HEIC support.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"48b5afbb3dafc1f9f217853d03164bc44011b8ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/trees/48b5afbb3dafc1f9f217853d03164bc44011b8ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/git/commits/0fbc64a183cdb4408990bc5f144caaf299543400","verification":{"payload":"tree 48b5afbb3dafc1f9f217853d03164bc44011b8ad\nparent 439bef98cf704d8094366c3d87c7c06514b664b3\nauthor FishGit2020 <58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com> 1775584038 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775584038 -0700\n\nfix(hsa-expenses): use heic2any for cross-browser HEIC conversion (#956)\n\nCanvas-based HEIC decode only works on Safari/WebKit — Chrome on macOS\ncannot decode HEIC natively, causing img.onerror and the \"Invalid file\ntype\" error. Replace with heic2any (pure-JS decoder) which works in all\nbrowsers regardless of native HEIC support.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp1UMmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAd0QQAHwtCmu/ICoFPZcWpjdat998\nm8nwHneq5xsUspmmthhPzDNN0lyNt7I3CXrdfUPSIgXwnTfB2hUihXtlT05VkvJz\naNincuSZiuPKIKCQHZep0TvSMqHBqWVhm8cg0a4gwt6QJnPbBH8AVOQ3jdvLSC/A\nHFJC4d/xKjc+q28VsJ021qgo8ZberYEOi5acdhgVubkUMim7iaMdjChQ0/RmIB0D\nmwJ977U9abfFeuMRVvhrylDKXnPXnzPKr8XEx22I7pobNKxlvXFxYZCnaA4fvh6C\nWgbviJXq5E8XRSfDFztpc5ytjy7b3LpUFrdOAmiE1/dESUK4jSbatv/0J9XtPFpj\nrS5fyO6P0exjM5sU+9WJ/2JlPbwCREyLekHeSJFZ7eosLaOjBmhTvg+a8EQaW6Tl\nYKvoFND86FZObgfQbqNrLwXz2NaRcKwJe+/5xK4W1RIMJMq4Aan1l1PfmvKo+bwd\nFqP3x+8Y4zUe3uqgens/oiW7dS6wSdeSYqq82Vyau08mxmSLNiCn38oeK8ietmS9\nh+K47wlRqvDTomwDcDRhwFbTKZ4lHNYNkKASBeNmbHmlbG3h2Q6UgrATusc+XVSQ\njbtH5jwkdIAE3PDSfelOhaKdwpM59vL0bFdGi9SY6y+tUs4yYhqa2cBrlqf0kCxN\njLEwcCz8yEGedsf/zCRT\n=VmGL\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-07T17:47:19Z"}},