92632,"login":"FishGit2020","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NzkyNjMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FishGit2020","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/MyCircle/commits/439bef98cf704d8094366c3d87c7c06514b664b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-07T17:05:31Z","email":"58792632+FishGit2020@users.noreply.github.com","name":"FishGit2020"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-07T17:05:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(security): resolve 9 npm audit vulnerabilities via pnpm overrides (#955)\n\nFixed (9 vulns removed, 25 → 12 remaining):\n- node-forge >=1.4.0: 4x HIGH in firebase-admin (cert bypass, Ed25519/RSA signature forgery, BigInteger DoS)\n- path-to-regexp 0.1.13: HIGH ReDoS in express@4 chain\n- path-to-regexp 8.4.0: HIGH+MODERATE DoS in MCP SDK > express@5 chain\n- hono >=4.12.7: MODERATE prototype pollution via MCP SDK\n- fast-xml-parser >=5.5.7: fix wrong override (was >=5.5.6, still installed vulnerable 5.5.6)\n\nNot fixed (intentional):\n- vite@5/7 vulns: dev server only; requires vite major version upgrade of all MFE tooling\n- brace-expansion in eslint/firebase-tools/@capacitor: dev-only CLI tools\n- lodash/yaml in @graphql-codegen: build-time tool, template injection not applicable\n- @xmldom/xmldom in epubjs: 0.7→0.8 API breaking change risk\n- @tootallnate/once: low severity, transitive firebase-admin dep\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2ce0c31ccb96552a0129035c3b69ebf4c82ae58d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FishGit2020/